    <node id="Richard E. Bonney">
      <data key="d0">Richard E. Bonney</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Richard E. Bonney is the author of two books on the subject of beekeeping. The first, "Beekeeping: A Practical Guide," is a book intended for beginners about acquiring and managing bees, based on his personal beekeeping experience in the northeastern United States. The second book he authored is "Hive Management," which is a guide to various beekeeping tasks and is listed under the "Practical Beekeeping" category.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a5bf9269446157b7f585b574d80342a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19adc067f85e17ae856f88441c8e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066653911102a71446dc7a3246a0c193</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Storey Publishing">
      <data key="d0">Storey Publishing</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Storey Publishing is a book publisher located in North Adams, Massachusetts, specializing in titles related to farming, gardening, nature, homesteading, and country living skills, such as crafts and livestock management. Their mission is to publish practical information that encourages personal independence in harmony with the environment. They operate the website www.storey.com and can be contacted via phone. Storey Publishing has released books by authors such as Sandy Shores, Richard E. Bonney, Gail Damerow, Monte Burch, and Merrilees, Wolfe, and Loveday, covering topics like herbs, beekeeping, chickens, barns, and fences. They have also published titles like "Storey's Guide to Raising Pigs", "The Perfect Pumpkin", "Storey's Guide to Raising Llamas", and "Making Your Small Farm Profitable". Storey Publishing is presented as a key resource for small farmers.&lt;SEP&gt;Storey Publishing is the publisher of 'Reclaiming Our Food.' Their stated mission is to publish practical information that encourages personal independence in harmony with the environment. It is located in North Adams, MA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a5bf9269446157b7f585b574d80342a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a25021ab306ceaf5d58e192cc6fc0a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2b2fd01aa45dadaa82a243d140ec5f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066653911102a71446dc7a3246a0c193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aeb69db517fc797c325acc9dcb88413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e410bfae74fb6896e8e0079e060cf83d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-516da735be61616733781bd48e941fba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34502be14cbf099cb7c93ccf9aeb56c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51cfeabc3f21e3329484ec062ac1c4b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f19adc067f85e17ae856f88441c8e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2920f4362eb05a4692fa915ca812b425&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1bfb736a960a0ceee22d5eb6f8e955</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Beekeeping">
      <data key="d0">Beekeeping</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Based on the information provided, beekeeping is the multifaceted practice, art, craft, and science of raising and maintaining honey bee colonies, which are typically kept in hives. It is explicitly included in the definition of farming and is practiced for honey production and pollination services. Beekeeping can be a hobby or a potential sideline business and takes place in various locations, including urban settings like Chicago and Vancouver.

This dynamic endeavor requires a significant and consistent time commitment, continuous learning, regular work, and preparation. It is more than just owning bees; it involves active management, with key tasks including hive inspection, seasonal management, honey harvesting and storage, and maintaining bee health. Understanding concepts like the swarm impulse is a critical lesson for beekeepers. Prospective beekeepers should be aware that it requires a significant initial financial investment and has associated startup costs and legal considerations. The field is supported by publications such as the 'American Bee Journal' and 'Bee Culture', and connecting with the broader beekeeping community is beneficial for success. While beekeeping has its challenging "down sides," it also offers rewarding "up sides" and benefits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-64bd868f29e83effc96703b72e21cc18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a5bf9269446157b7f585b574d80342a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3025455da6b06dabe347fe4878bb963&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60575ab4028f754c314fcbcee392db85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6550c1217ac242a6cb1c3d9a5de5ee35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-066653911102a71446dc7a3246a0c193&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5aeb69db517fc797c325acc9dcb88413&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3360008b23c172924071e48d0800392e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-475015ec5f08648d774910da2fb23967</data>
