    <node id="History Of Beekeeping">
      <data key="d0">History Of Beekeeping</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"The study of the craft's evolution, which is divided into at least three historical eras and a potential fourth. Understanding this history helps explain current practices, techniques, and attitudes in beekeeping."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A topic covered in the book to provide historical context for the practice of beekeeping.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a5bf9269446157b7f585b574d80342a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f78f364d74eca8b91a5a10f5f9de4b</data>
