      <data key="d0">Government Agencies</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"Government Agencies are identified as an important source of new information, research, and developments for beekeepers. Staying in contact with them is recommended for success."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Government agencies are organizations mentioned as a resource or entity relevant to farmers, listed on pages 261-262.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60575ab4028f754c314fcbcee392db85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a464eab8eee71e80f3498a79e8163ee7</data>
