      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Apis koschevnikovi is a recently acknowledged species of honey bee, mentioned as being found primarily in Southeast Asia.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2a11bfe1dc62c3ee867b5e29138914b</data>
