      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A type of location where honey bees can be exposed to pesticides, alongside orchards and home gardens.&lt;SEP&gt;Farms are physical locations for farming. The text defines family and small farms, lists reasons for owning them, and mentions their potential as tourist destinations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d711f27560f7987b017b85fa9c8a2e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a464eab8eee71e80f3498a79e8163ee7</data>
