      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A core component of Growing Gardens' programs, where the organization installs gardens at the homes of low-income families. The text states over seven hundred have been created."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A common location where honey bees may be inadvertently exposed to pesticides used by homeowners.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8ed0d32c6d653b34677909bb2a4df08b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d711f27560f7987b017b85fa9c8a2e56</data>
