      <data key="d0">Dadant and Sons</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A multifaceted beekeeping organization that edits and publishes 'The Hive and the Honey Bee'. It is also a primary mail-order source for beekeeping books and equipment, and the publisher of the 'American Bee journal' magazine. It is located in Hamilton, Illinois.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04</data>
