      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An author and editor of several influential beekeeping books, including co-editing 'The Illustrated Encyclopedia of Beekeeping', authoring 'The Complete Guide to Beekeeping', and editing 'Honey Bee Pests, Predators, and Diseases'.&lt;SEP&gt;Author of 'The New Complete Guide to Beekeeping', a book about starting and maintaining bees.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f19adc067f85e17ae856f88441c8e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04</data>
