      <data key="d0">A.I. Root Co.</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A prominent beekeeping company that published A. I. Root's 'The ABC and XYZ of Bee Culture' and a reprint of Langstroth's classic work. It is also a source for books and the publisher of 'Bee Culture' magazine, located in Medina, Ohio.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04</data>
