      <data key="d0">Cornell University Press</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A publisher of academic beekeeping books, including Karl von Frisch's 'Bees: Their Vision, Chemical Sense, and Language' and Roger A. Morse's 'Honey Bee Pests, Predators, and Diseases'. It is located in Ithaca, New York.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7f1d34c0baad55bf46a357beac030d04</data>
