      <data key="d2">A mail-order source for beekeeping equipment and bees, listed for beginners seeking to purchase supplies. It is located in Greenwich, New York.&lt;SEP&gt;Betterbee is a beekeeping equipment supplier located in Greenwich, New York. The text provides its phone number and website.</data>
