    <node id="U.s.">
      <data key="d0">U.s.</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The U.S. (United States) is a geographical region mentioned in the context of the historical introduction of honey bees.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States. The text contrasts Hickory Nut Gap Farm's grass-fed model with the practices of most U.S. feedlots, which prioritize fast weight gain with larger-frame animals.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ee2dbfbb5c1a5664034bad31b4143c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8f3e81fd6708a9852f46f0d4ac0a0</data>
