      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Author of the book 'Making Your Small Farm Profitable', which aims to provide guidance on farm management and new agricultural enterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;Ron Macher is a veteran farmer, author of 'Making Your Small Farm Profitable', and the founder of the 'Small Farm Today' magazine. He is described as a strong advocate for the small farm community and a friend and colleague of Howard W. 'Bud' Kerr, Jr.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2b2fd01aa45dadaa82a243d140ec5f5</data>
