      <data key="d0">Howard W. 'Bud' Kerr, Jr.</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Howard W. 'Bud' Kerr, Jr. is the former Director of the Office of Small-Scale Agriculture at the U.S. Department of Agriculture. He authored the introduction to the text, highlighting his friendship with Ron Macher and their shared advocacy for small farms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wrote the foreword for the book 'Making Your Small Farm Profitable'. The foreword discusses the state of small farms in America.</data>
