      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The academic department at the University of Missouri-Columbia associated with authors Charles D. DeCourley and Kevin C. Moore and their publication, 'Selected Fruit and Vegetable Planning Budgets'.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8448fec2abb01962b8a2c019dd0efd50</data>
