    <node id="Community-supported agriculture (CSAs)">
      <data key="d0">Community-supported agriculture (CSAs)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Community-supported agriculture (CSAs) are described as a key innovation within the grassroots food movement, having experienced significant growth from 60 projects in 1990 to over 3,500.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51cfeabc3f21e3329484ec062ac1c4b2</data>
