    <node id="American Farming">
      <data key="d0">American Farming</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">American farming is described in the foreword as a system at a critical historical point, facing degradation and economic challenges, and is the context against which the grassroots food movement is rising.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51cfeabc3f21e3329484ec062ac1c4b2</data>
