      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A term for the innovative individuals-land stewards, food distributors, chefs, and others-who are actively remaking food systems. They are described as prioritizing traceability and creating alternatives to the mass-produced food industry.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d86135a3ecce951cb211b81554dd41c0</data>
