      <data key="d0">Evergreen College</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A college in Olympia, Washington, where undergraduate student Richard Doss initiated the Kitchen Garden Project in 1992.&lt;SEP&gt;Evergreen College is the educational institution in Olympia, Washington, where Richard Doss was a student and initiated the Kitchen Garden Project as a course for credit.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82372fd5a606e148caa2a0647673892b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aaeba6a87de6589129068300a4f26db</data>
