    <node id="Olympia, Washington">
      <data key="d0">Olympia, Washington</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Olympia, Washington, is the city where Richard Doss, a student at Evergreen College, founded the Kitchen Garden Project, which later became the nonprofit GRuB.&lt;SEP&gt;The city and state that is home to Evergreen College, where a community food project was started.&lt;SEP&gt;The city and state where Fungi Perfecti Llc is located.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-82372fd5a606e148caa2a0647673892b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c07830327394a77dc9e8ac1a53acd63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aaeba6a87de6589129068300a4f26db</data>
