      <data key="d0">Seed Sorting Party</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An event organized by Growing Gardens where volunteers and program participants can contribute to the community effort.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9b822de4a60aeb5f83933b9cd0a946c9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Plant Distribution Day">
      <data key="d0">Plant Distribution Day</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An annual event hosted by Growing Gardens where plants grown by volunteers are distributed to home gardeners, with first-year participants receiving priority and basic supplies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9b822de4a60aeb5f83933b9cd0a946c9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="New Home Gardeners">
      <data key="d0">New Home Gardeners</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The target population and participants of the Growing Gardens program. They have diverse levels of gardening expertise and receive comprehensive support.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9b822de4a60aeb5f83933b9cd0a946c9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Volunteers">
      <data key="d0">Volunteers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A central theme of the text, referring to individuals who provide unpaid labor to non-profit organizations and community farms. The text discusses strategies for recruiting, managing, valuing, and handling liability for volunteers."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"A crucial group of people from schools, youth groups, and the local community who provided tens of thousands of hours of labor to transform the abandoned site into the Lynchburg Grows farm."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A crucial group of people who support Growing Gardens' mission by teaching workshops, mentoring, installing gardens, and growing plants for distribution.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4daf18984831b8673c2be0060612bd34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b822de4a60aeb5f83933b9cd0a946c9</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740785</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Homeowners">
      <data key="d0">Homeowners</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A primary client category for the for-profit Seattle Urban Farm Company, which provides them with garden design, installation, and maintenance services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9b822de4a60aeb5f83933b9cd0a946c9</data>
