      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A type of market often overlooked by large corporations. It is characterized by limited interest from mainstream business, controlled volume, low capital risk, and opportunities for diversification. The text presents it as a viable strategy for small-scale producers to prosper."&gt;</data>
