    <node id="Oklahoma">
      <data key="d0">Oklahoma</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Oklahoma is a U.S. state located in the Southern United States. The Oklahoma Food Cooperative is located and operates within Oklahoma, facilitating the sale of locally grown farm products. Oklahoma was also mentioned alongside Texas as a state where numerous farmers gave up on the ratite market following its collapse.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a214f4e9d9f3d3fed74243c9bdf50bf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-104466acc0eb6f55c05f02aa258ea31a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e2a281158355949bfa9c35a51c5622a</data>
