      <data key="d0">Bay Area</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">"A geographical region in California where ForageSF operates. It is the target area for the organization's mission to connect residents with wild foods, and where Kevin Feinstein leads foraging walks."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A populous region in Northern California where the enterprise Dig Deep Farms operates, converting blighted land to agricultural purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb8186cf72c91110756ec67bcc379a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dbce12e45fe13ef4f6973f92e57e779</data>
