      <data key="d0">Kevin Feinstein</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A representative for ForageSF."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"An expert who leads foraging walks in the Bay Area and Mendocino County. He teaches safe identification, preparation, and ethical harvesting of wild foods, including greens, bark, and mushrooms."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dbce12e45fe13ef4f6973f92e57e779</data>
