    <node id="Community Farms and Gardens">
      <data key="d0">Community Farms and Gardens</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Described as powerful tools for reconnecting people, especially children, with food production. They offer hands-on education about soil, ecosystems, and nutrition, and are seen as a gateway to creating local food systems and influencing food policy."&gt;</data>
