      <data key="d0">Wild Foods</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Foods that are foraged from the natural environment, such as mushrooms, ramps, and native seafood. ForageSF is an advocacy group for this category of food, aiming to make it a staple of the food system."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dbce12e45fe13ef4f6973f92e57e779</data>
