      <data key="d2">"A specific type of nut used as a detailed example to illustrate how processing (shelling) dramatically increases product value. The text contrasts the price of whole walnuts ($0.10-$0.50/lb) with walnut meats ($7/lb) and compares the efficiency of hand-cracking versus machine-cracking."&gt;</data>
