      <data key="d2">"A specific category of processed meat with distinct storage characteristics. The text notes that cured meats have a shorter safe storage time in the freezer (1-2 months) compared to other meats."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a5deb38ed9dc0a60bcac768fbb7955c</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
