    <node id="Food festivals">
      <data key="d0">Food festivals</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">"Described as the 'major leagues' of shows, these are high-cost, high-stakes events for professional producers with a good cash reserve. Booths can cost $2,000 or more, and there are strict rules."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3eba3a070130b55e2912440d8aaca3d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740814</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Gourmet food fairs">
      <data key="d0">Gourmet food fairs</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">"A top-tier event category mentioned with Food Festivals. They are for professional, high-volume producers and require the ability to calculate production and delivery costs precisely for large orders."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3eba3a070130b55e2912440d8aaca3d2</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740814</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Living History events">
