      <data key="d2">"A type of non-traditional community gathering suggested as a potential marketing venue for farmers, listed among other opportunities like ballooning events and music festivals."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3eba3a070130b55e2912440d8aaca3d2</data>
