      <data key="d0">The Farm</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The central location discussed in the text, which is the subject of various marketing and customer attraction strategies. It can host events, offer products, and be developed into a destination by adding services and activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Williams' family property located on a desert plateau, consisting of about 10 acres of actively farmed fields and the site of a future 4-acre orchard. It is sustained by traditional irrigation methods and harsh weather conditions like sandstorms.</data>
