      <data key="d0">South Egremont, Massachusetts</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">South Egremont, a town in Massachusetts, is the location of Indian Line Farm, which is a pioneering Community Supported Agriculture (CSA) and one of the first of its kind in North America.</data>
