      <data key="d0">The Nature Conservancy</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"The Nature Conservancy is a non-profit organization that owns the conservation restriction rights to the land of Indian Line Farm, as part of a unique agreement to preserve the area's wetlands and working landscape."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A national land trust mentioned as an example, with a specific goal of conserving land with rare and endangered species and habitats.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0b1f6adc63dbe7f3160ab5bd7b25233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-951f3a20705ad68da0aafd6377f51f52</data>
