      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An organization targeted for farm tours. Senior citizens are noted as a good customer base, enjoying nostalgic farm visits and being potential buyers of gift packs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2afc9b5400cf61bfbec7b607b711ba96</data>
