      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"Al Thorp is a farmer at Indian Line Farm who partnered with Elizabeth Keen to continue the farm's operation after the death of the original owner, Robyn Van En."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;An individual named in the text.</data>
