      <data key="d0">American Farmland Trust</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A national land trust mentioned as an example, focused on preserving important farmland.&lt;SEP&gt;American Farmland Trust is an organization dedicated to the mission of saving farmland.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c0b1f6adc63dbe7f3160ab5bd7b25233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57c24510274e9c9fcb046e6b604285fd</data>
