      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A representative for the Southside Community Land Trust."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;An individual mentioned in the index.&lt;SEP&gt;Katherine Brown is the executive director of the Southside Community Land Trust (SCLT). She explains the organization's collaborative and flexible approach to managing the Urban Edge Farm with its farmers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a170afca78fc7741f470417682836f82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73</data>
