    <node id="Tree Crops">
      <data key="d0">Tree Crops</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to trees that are cultivated for profit, such as for timber, firewood, or nursery stock. The text suggests they can be highly profitable, citing quick-growing varieties like Pawlonia and bamboo as good choices.</data>
