    <node id="Net Profit">
      <data key="d0">Net Profit</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A key financial metric representing income after all expenses are deducted. It is used to compare the profitability of different enterprises, both as a total figure and as a percentage of gross income.</data>
