    <node id="Johnson">
      <data key="d0">Johnson</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An expert with decades of experience in community gardening. She believes successful gardens are started by gardeners for gardeners and is critical of top-down approaches from corporations and large nonprofits that lack community involvement and leadership.&lt;SEP&gt;Referred to as Betsy Johnson, she is an expert and narrator on the history and impact of community gardens, providing multiple examples and historical context throughout the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-174591c0f94ab01a05c96941979500a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43ebc646508b0f93fb43f529856b4d56</data>
