      <data key="d0">Sweet Sorghum</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific crop that is one of Steve Salt's main products. He grows four or five acres, processes it using a neighbor's equipment, and sells the resulting syrup.&lt;SEP&gt;An example of a specific alternative crop that a farmer could potentially raise.</data>
