    <node id="Bobwhite Quail (Meat Birds)">
      <data key="d0">Bobwhite Quail (Meat Birds)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A farming operation involving raising Bobwhite quail for meat. The model is based on purchasing day-old birds and selling them at 13 weeks. For a scenario with 3 groups of 1,000 birds and a 15% death loss (2,550 birds sold), the net profit is $3,620.00 with 220 hours of labor. Gross income is $6,757.00, and expenses include $1,457.00 for feed and $1,680.00 for other variable costs."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59117004fc63073a0e772f7ea1ce4399</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740819</data>
    </node>
