      <data key="d2">"A farming operation for raising pheasants. The model involves purchasing 200 day-old chicks and selling them at 20 weeks as flight birds. It generates a net profit of $312.00 from $1,120.00 in income. Expenses include $423.00 for feed, $180.00 for chicks, and $205.00 for other costs. It requires 120 hours of labor."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59117004fc63073a0e772f7ea1ce4399</data>
