      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A farming operation for raising rabbits for meat (fryers). The model is based on 20 does and 2 bucks producing 5 litters per year, with fryers sold at 10 weeks. This generates a net profit of $1,271.00 from a gross income of $2,800.00. Expenses include $1,400.00 for feed and $129.00 for other costs, requiring 200 hours of labor."&gt;</data>
