      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">An enterprise focused on buying 70-pound feeder lambs and fattening them to 120 pounds for sale. This model is characterized by low labor (1 hour) and a net profit of $14.02 per lamb.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a6d072f41d662cb326c1c528ac3c5c51</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740821</data>
