      <data key="d0">P-Patch Trust</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization that evolved from a grassroots volunteer group. It supports Seattle's P-Patch Program by securing land and raising funds, ensuring its long-term stability.</data>
