    <node id="Wasongolo">
      <data key="d0">Wasongolo</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A leader at Village Gardens who strongly emphasizes that all decisions about a community garden must be made jointly by all members through a collaborative process.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07f097aee6be0e05076e0e695419438a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740821</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Amber Baker">
      <data key="d0">Amber Baker</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Amber Baker is the Program Director for the Village Gardens program in Portland, which is part of Janus Youth Programs. Describing herself as an "outsider" to the community, she strongly advocates for a community-centric approach, emphasizing the importance of listening to residents, building relationships, and respecting the community's authority rather than imposing an external agenda.

In her leadership role, Baker supports a strategic decision to focus on deepening the program's impact within its existing community instead of pursuing constant expansion. She advocates for creative staffing, which includes hiring from the community and paying living wages, and stresses the importance of staff understanding their specific roles. Believing that regular meetings are crucial for building community, she advises new garden organizers to learn from the experiences of others. Additionally, Baker actively documents and shares stories about the positive health and social impacts the gardens have on children and adults.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c46a7f814f9b988da76a9ac71bdab30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45291ea55455adae718c5031c0e8dfff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0adcf3a18e5a064a6ed2b9d46dff75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edff28cc5d3b6f311f02cd2481c28fb7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a815073ae837fa29833af41e55990ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f097aee6be0e05076e0e695419438a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740821</data>
    </node>
