      <data key="d0">McVey Stone Company</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A local business that donated bluestone to the Worcester Street Garden for the construction of new, non-toxic raised beds.&lt;SEP&gt;A local business that donated bluestone to the Worcester Street Garden to create new, non-toxic raised beds.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-cf60421969007759eb279ddb028ec67b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07f097aee6be0e05076e0e695419438a</data>
