    <node id="New Orleans Food and Farm Network">
      <data key="d0">New Orleans Food and Farm Network</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"An organization based in New Orleans focused on connecting and supporting the local food and farming community."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;An organization formed in New Orleans after Hurricane Katrina. It created the Community Food Charter, advocating for a vibrant food system as central to a community's health and sustainable future.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Orleans Food and Farm Network is an organization mentioned in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c9669112f71f37c0273243e8cc59e05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf60421969007759eb279ddb028ec67b</data>
