      <data key="d2">A crop with agricultural economic data provided per acre, including a gross income of $7,686.00, total variable costs of $3,101.00, a net profit of $4,585.00, and requiring 306 labor hours.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04b17869172fff33b1c7bc2284173657</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
