      <data key="d2">"An organization at 909 7th Street in Oakland, CA. Representatives include Jumoke Hinton Hodge, Nikki Henderson, and Max Kurtz-Cadji."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"An organization focused on food justice and providing access to healthy food, likely in an urban area."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A community-based organization in West Oakland, California, that works to build a local food system and address social justice issues through community engagement, leadership development, a microfarm, and various health and nutrition programs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8186cf72c91110756ec67bcc379a67</data>
