    </node>
    <node id="Highland Hospital">
      <data key="d0">Highland Hospital</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A public hospital in East Oakland that is collaborating with People's Grocery on the 'Bite to Balance' case study to track the health of children receiving fresh produce.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb8186cf72c91110756ec67bcc379a67</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740827</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Farm Equipment">
      <data key="d0">Farm Equipment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Farm Equipment is a major category discussed, covering a range from fencing materials and hand tools (hoes, plows) to mechanized machinery like two-wheel walk-behind tractors and four-wheel ride-on tractors. The text emphasizes making need-based decisions to manage costs."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The central subject of the text, encompassing machinery used in farming like tractors, combines, plows, and planters. The text details its maintenance, costs (ownership and operating), and economic considerations.&lt;SEP&gt;The central topic of the text, which covers its maintenance, cost analysis, useful life, and methods for acquisition such as through dealerships, private sales, and auctions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d2c2f40ce23609da02bb09b06c26efd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6b34a5b7dc86e95b65f36512f72980b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8cfe86ed3c97ccb7c9629ee2dac08b4</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740829</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Good Fences for Your Farm">
      <data key="d0">Good Fences for Your Farm</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"'Good Fences for Your Farm' is the title of the University of Missouri Extension Circular 667, written by Carl Scheneman and Albert Hagan in 1956. It provides detailed instructions on fence construction."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f6b34a5b7dc86e95b65f36512f72980b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740829</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Small Farmer">
      <data key="d0">Small Farmer</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A Small Farmer is the target audience of the text, defined as an operator for whom time and capital are the most limiting factors for success. The text provides advice on equipment and economic viability for this group."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f6b34a5b7dc86e95b65f36512f72980b</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740829</data>
