      <data key="d0">Bite to Balance\" case study</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A collaborative research project between People's Grocery and Highland Hospital to determine if providing weekly fresh produce (Grub Boxes) affects the health of children with diet-related problems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bb8186cf72c91110756ec67bcc379a67</data>
