      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"A company founded by Will Raap that is an anchor tenant at the Intervale. It includes a large retail store, company offices, and research plots."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Gardener's Supply Company, based in Burlington, Vermont, sells a range of garden supplies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c977e0c22629a3b90f1214c2370c4394&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57c24510274e9c9fcb046e6b604285fd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
