      <data key="d2">"A community garden at the Intervale where Burlington residents can lease small plots to grow their own vegetables."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A community garden that is part of the Intervale, where residents of Burlington can lease small plots to grow their own vegetables.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c977e0c22629a3b90f1214c2370c4394&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd12c93ca420ae0dfd8107f51eec1886</data>
