    <node id="Farmers Market Nutrition Program (FMNP)">
      <data key="d0">Farmers Market Nutrition Program (FMNP)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Farmers Market Nutrition Program (FMNP) is a federal program that provides supplemental funds to low-income mothers and seniors for purchasing fresh food at farmers' markets. Greensgrow participates in this program.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6576c76d8821b0180981d641c63968e5</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740830</data>
