      <data key="d2">A farm and publisher located in Swoope, VA, associated with author Joel Salatin. It published his books 'Pastured Poultry Profits' and 'You Can Farm'.&lt;SEP&gt;The publisher of 'Salad Bar Beef', located in Swoope, Virginia.</data>
