    <node id="Rivera">
      <data key="d0">Rivera</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A community leader who works with Nuestras Raíces. She started as a volunteer gardener, joined the board, initiated the 'Cuenta Con Migo' youth garden, and conducted 35 'Healthy Homes Workshops' to educate residents on environmental health issues like indoor air quality.&lt;SEP&gt;Rivera is an individual quoted in the text who comments on the political power gained when communities come together through projects like gardens, and how these spaces change how people feel about their living environment.</data>
