    <node id="Birmingham">
      <data key="d0">Birmingham</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Birmingham, a city in the state of Alabama, is home to the Jones Valley Urban Farm (JVUF), which operates on a 3-acre city block in its downtown area. JVUF's efforts are focused on improving food awareness, education, and health within the Birmingham community. Additionally, the city has an active Obesity Task Force that has implemented strategies such as training school cafeteria staff in nutrition and fresh food preparation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0adcf3a18e5a064a6ed2b9d46dff75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467</data>
