    <node id="Harry's Mother">
      <data key="d0">Harry's Mother</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Harry's Mother is a youth shelter and runaway program center in Portland, Oregon, operated by the Janus Youth organization. It served as the starting point for Janus Youth's gardening programs, beginning with a small, therapeutic garden patch in front of the building for the runaway and homeless kids the center served. This initial project eventually expanded significantly, growing into the organization's larger urban agriculture program and community food projects. Later, due to budget cuts, the Harry's Mother property was sold, which forced the original garden to be relocated and rebuilt.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9f8b5f47647da9706f2d5877b878fae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa6369dd0584465f07387131c6d28e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05be2e4c27c7eabe9de8d2ff56b840a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740833</data>
    </node>
