    <node id="Tricycle Gardens' Lease Agreement">
      <data key="d0">Tricycle Gardens' Lease Agreement</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific agreement negotiated in 2010 where Tricycle Gardens secured a half-acre lot from a private developer in Richmond, VA, for only $5 per year. This event was made possible by an economic downturn that halted development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740833</data>
    </node>
    <node id="JVUF Suit">
      <data key="d0">JVUF Suit</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A legal dispute in which Jones Valley Urban Farm was sued for 'back rent' by a landowner after a verbal agreement. JVUF won the lawsuit, and the experience serves as a key example of why written land-use agreements are essential.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740833</data>
    </node>
