      <data key="d0">Puerto Rican food heritage</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A cultural tradition that the organization Nuestras Raíces actively celebrates and preserves through its community farming and business incubation programs in Holyoke, Massachusetts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996</data>
