    <node id="Oregon">
      <data key="d0">Oregon</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Oregon is a state in the Pacific Northwest of the United States that is home to several notable locations, including Multnomah County, Portland, Abernethy School, and the Yamsi Ranch. The non-profit organization Janus Youth Programs, Inc. was founded and operates extensively throughout the state. Historically, Oregon has faced significant challenges; at one point, it had the highest food insecurity rate in the nation, which spurred the creation of the Food Works program. In 2003, Janus Youth was negatively impacted by major cuts to the Oregon state budget.

The state is frequently associated with various agricultural and urban farming initiatives. It is the location of the Southern Willamette Valley Bean and Grain Project, which is actively working to rebuild a local grain economy. Additionally, Oregon is the source for locally grown produce featured in programs like the 'Harvest of the Month' at Abernethy school. The state is also the location of the Williamson River, which is recognized as one of Oregon's best trout fisheries.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-05be2e4c27c7eabe9de8d2ff56b840a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09e000817f207794412f1a62763dda17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8b5f47647da9706f2d5877b878fae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fa6369dd0584465f07387131c6d28e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d4150698732f393c235b8b3e1cb2d88</data>
