    <node id="Economic Development">
      <data key="d0">Economic Development</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A central theme in the text, presented as a goal that can be achieved by connecting local farms, tourism, and small businesses through a food-oriented strategy like 'Foodtopia'.&lt;SEP&gt;A primary goal of Janus Youth's urban agriculture program, aiming to create jobs, develop skills, and foster economic opportunities within the community.</data>
