    <node id="Sustainable Agriculture Network">
      <data key="d0">Sustainable Agriculture Network</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An organization located in Burlington, VT, that published 'Managing Cover Crops Profitably', an excellent guide to choosing and growing cover crops.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that publishes guides on agricultural tools and practices, including 'Steel in the Field' and 'Managing Cover Crops Profitably'.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f19adc067f85e17ae856f88441c8e7d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1bfb736a960a0ceee22d5eb6f8e955</data>
