      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A representative for Janus Youth Programs."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A single mother and garden leader at Seeds of Harmony who emphasizes the importance of commitment and has gained valuable job skills. She also notes the positive impact of the garden on her son's diet.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
