      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An immigrant from Togo who is heavily involved in the community store planning. His entire family is active in the garden programs, including his son Egvebado and daughter in Food Works.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual mentioned in the index, likely related to Egvebado Ananouko.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
