    <node id="Village Gardens Program">
      <data key="d0">Village Gardens Program</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Village Gardens Program is a key initiative of Janus Youth, founded by Tera Wick. It focuses on establishing community gardens by listening to the community's wants and needs, with a notable project in St. Johns Woods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-45291ea55455adae718c5031c0e8dfff</data>
