      <data key="d2">"A leadership role within the Food Works program, held by teens who participated in the program the previous year. They must apply and be interviewed, and they help design the program alongside adults."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A leadership role within the Food Works program, filled by teens who worked in the program the previous year. They spend a month with adults to co-design the entire year's program.</data>
