    <node id="White House">
      <data key="d0">White House</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The White House is the official residence of the U.S. President and was historically decorated with roses grown at the Schenkel's greenhouse complex. It has been the location for various initiatives, particularly those by First Lady Michelle Obama. As a symbolic act supporting the food movement, Michelle Obama planted a backyard garden on the grounds. In connection with her "Move Chefs to Schools" initiative, Chef Charles Hudson was invited to the White House to participate in the program in recognition of his work.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16c3fe8c089550fd16987a1c4f301a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60071a35b7d93bd331a3e0d32f9f3fe4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
