      <data key="d0">Peter R. Cheeke</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A co-author of 'Rabbit Production, 5th ed.', described as an excellent guide to raising rabbits.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead author of 'Rabbit Production, 5th ed.', a guide to raising rabbits listed under the Small Stock category.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a25021ab306ceaf5d58e192cc6fc0a84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea1bfb736a960a0ceee22d5eb6f8e955</data>
