    <node id="Gerard Ramos">
      <data key="d0">Gerard Ramos</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A representative for Nuestras Raíces."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Gerard Ramos is the founder of Marine Reef Habitat. Originally from Puerto Rico, he is an entrepreneur who discovered a species of coral resistant to invasive algae and aims to use it to repopulate and clean up his native waters.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42</data>
