    </node>
    <node id="Center For Creative Community Development (C3D)">
      <data key="d0">Center For Creative Community Development (C3D)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An organization focused on creative approaches to community development.&lt;SEP&gt;The Center for Creative Community Development (C3D) is a research center that conducted a 2007 study on Nuestras Raíces. The study concluded that the nonprofit had a total annual economic impact of over $2 million on the Holyoke community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Incubator Model">
      <data key="d0">Incubator Model</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The Incubator Model is a core strategy used by Nuestras Raíces to support and develop new farmers and small businesses. The model's primary challenge is helping participants gain long-term access to land and capital.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Low-Income Community">
      <data key="d0">Low-Income Community</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The primary demographic served by the Nuestras Raíces organization in Holyoke. This community faces significant barriers, such as lack of access to land and capital, which the organization aims to address.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Seasonal Planning">
      <data key="d0">Seasonal Planning</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical and difficult aspect of farming in Massachusetts, as highlighted by Andaluz, due to the short six-month growing season. This contrasts with regions like the Caribbean, requiring farmers to have a solid plan.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="C3D Study">
      <data key="d0">C3D Study</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A formal study conducted in February 2007 by the Center for Creative Community Development that analyzed and quantified the economic impact of Nuestras Raíces on the Holyoke community, finding it to be over $2 million annually.&lt;SEP&gt;A study mentioned in the text that analyzed the economic impact of community-based food organizations like Nuestras Raíces. Its findings suggest these organizations can provide significant localized economic benefits beyond just food production.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aab30ee2b8630558ddd6575d42c69264</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Farmer Training Course">
      <data key="d0">Farmer Training Course</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An annual educational program offered by Nuestras Raíces to teach prospective farmers agricultural skills and business planning. Successful graduates may gain access to a plot at La Finca.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ee782c1d8a631cff4fafc639994eb42</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740836</data>
    </node>
