    <node id="Lincoln, Massachusetts">
      <data key="d0">Lincoln, Massachusetts</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A wealthy suburban town outside Boston, known for its strong commitment to land conservation, Walden Pond, and the Thoreau Institute. It is a key location for The Food Project, hosting its 21-acre farm and serving as the site where the organization was founded.&lt;SEP&gt;Lincoln is a town in Massachusetts mentioned as a location in the text.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07d81959e2e7dfd429fb34ce74beae5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c9669112f71f37c0273243e8cc59e05</data>
