      <data key="d0">Drumlin Farm</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A historic farm in Lincoln that serves as the headquarters for the state Audubon Society. It is the original site where Ward Cheney started The Food Project on 2.5 acres of land.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-07d81959e2e7dfd429fb34ce74beae5e</data>
