      <data key="d0">Audubon Society</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A conservation organization whose state chapter is headquartered at Drumlin Farm in Lincoln, Massachusetts.&lt;SEP&gt;A non-profit environmental organization focused on conservation, mentioned in the index.&lt;SEP&gt;An environmental organization that collaborated with the Hatfield family. The partnership involved setting aside wetlands on the Hatfield ranch to provide critical nesting habitat for migrating waterfowl.</data>
