    <node id="The Food Project Pilot Program">
      <data key="d0">The Food Project Pilot Program</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The initial two-year pilot program started by Ward Cheney in 1991 on 2.5 acres at Drumlin Farm. It successfully proved the viability of the project's model by growing and donating 20,000 pounds of food annually with a small team of teens.</data>
