      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A program in Missouri that assists with adding value to farm products and labeling. It is provided as an example of a state-level agricultural program.&lt;SEP&gt;A state program in Missouri designed for adding value to and labeling farm products.</data>
