      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A hypothetical nationwide program envisioned by the author. It would provide all children in the United States with the opportunity to spend time on a food farm for educational, personal health, and skill-building purposes.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8965f3e3965322fdf5c53aebddde1e14</data>
