      <data key="d0">Diversity and Inclusion</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A foundational principle of The Food Project's program, which involves intentionally mixing youths from different social and economic backgrounds and using structured workshops to teach them how to deal with their differences, fostering camaraderie and growth.</data>
