      <data key="d2">A comprehensive concept including the production, processing, and distribution of food. The text suggests The Food Project missed opportunities to teach about this broader context.&lt;SEP&gt;A topic of study within the ASAP course, covering the regional, national, and global history and structure of how food is produced and distributed.</data>
