    <node id="Peaceful Valley Farm &amp; Garden Supply">
      <data key="d0">Peaceful Valley Farm &amp; Garden Supply</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A company in Grass Valley, California, that provides tools and supplies specifically for organic farming.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c07830327394a77dc9e8ac1a53acd63</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Farm to School Movement">
      <data key="d0">Farm to School Movement</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A rapidly growing national movement with programs in all 50 states that connects schools with local farms. It aims to introduce fresh, local food into school menus, provide nutritional and agricultural education, and support local farmers.&lt;SEP&gt;A widespread social and educational trend across all 50 states involving parents, teachers, nutrition directors, and farmers. The movement aims to improve children's health and relationship with food through school-based initiatives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04be01c6169d0bdd92b10dca615a3936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Debra Eschmeyer">
      <data key="d0">Debra Eschmeyer</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The author of the section titled 'The Farm to School Movement', advocating for its benefits for children, farmers, and communities.&lt;SEP&gt;The outreach and communications director for the National Farm to School Network and a contributor to the book.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa8b612642fa385d2af41e902aa75d</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Childhood Obesity Epidemic">
      <data key="d0">Childhood Obesity Epidemic</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A major public health crisis in the United States, where obesity rates have doubled in children and tripled in adolescents. It is the primary issue that the food movements described in the text are trying to address.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="School Food">
      <data key="d0">School Food</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to the meals served in school cafeterias, which are identified as a key area for intervention. The text notes challenges such as low budgets (around $1 per meal for food), which often prioritize cost over quality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="School Food Services">
      <data key="d0">School Food Services</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The departments within schools responsible for providing student meals. They are described as facing an 'uphill battle' due to tight budgets, rising costs, and competition from fast food.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Parents">
      <data key="d0">Parents</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A key demographic targeted by the grassroots food movement, along with their children, to influence food buying and eating behaviors. They are also stakeholders in the Farm to School movement.&lt;SEP&gt;A key stakeholder group in school garden programs. Their involvement, such as co-teaching after-school clubs, is crucial for program sustainability. The text notes they are often impressed by their children's changed eating habits.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a7be9460651dfa3f1395f006df3ef8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea6dd73e41a475c9933ac4783be5f57a</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740842</data>
    </node>
