    <node id="Teachers">
      <data key="d0">Teachers</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A vital group for the success of school garden programs. They are identified as essential members of the garden committee and are trained to ensure the program's long-term sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Educational professionals identified as key participants in the Farm to School movement and grassroots efforts, helping to implement curricula on nutrition and agriculture.</data>
