    <node id="Farm to School Programs">
      <data key="d0">Farm to School Programs</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"A category of programs that aim to connect local farms with schools to provide fresh food for students and offer educational opportunities about agriculture and nutrition."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A program that connects schools (K–12) and local farms to serve healthy, local meals, provide nutrition and agriculture education, and support local farmers. It is positioned as a solution for improving child nutrition, community health, and local economies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7b79b32f16bacae95e48f2f51ab5dee0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
