    <node id="White House Childhood Obesity Task Force">
      <data key="d0">White House Childhood Obesity Task Force</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A U.S. presidential initiative created to address the issue of childhood obesity.&lt;SEP&gt;A government task force that, in May 2010, recommended Farm to School programs, school gardens, and nutrition education as community-based solutions to combat childhood obesity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38c9174dd4002f6529026fc7fd3c23f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
