    <node id="Children/Students">
      <data key="d0">Children/Students</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The primary beneficiaries of Farm to School programs. The programs aim to improve their nutrition, health, eating habits, and knowledge about food, agriculture, and sustainability. They show increased consumption of fruits/vegetables and willingness to try new foods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
