    <node id="Communities">
      <data key="d0">Communities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A major beneficiary of Farm to School programs. The programs contribute to creating strong and just local food systems, which in turn supports the health and economy of the community.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="The Environment">
      <data key="d0">The Environment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A beneficiary of Farm to School programs, which are described as ensuring the health of the environment, likely through supporting local, sustainable agriculture practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="The Economy">
      <data key="d0">The Economy</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A beneficiary of Farm to School programs, which support local economies by providing a significant and steady market for local farmers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Local and Regional Food Systems">
      <data key="d0">Local and Regional Food Systems</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">The framework within which Farm to School programs operate. The text describes these programs as 'essential components' for creating strong and just food systems.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="USDA Farm to School Team">
      <data key="d0">USDA Farm to School Team</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A specific team within the USDA, announced in September 2009, intended to support local and regional food systems by facilitating connections between schools and local food producers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fef6f9e3cdaa27cfe32361bcab20e464</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Farm to School Program">
      <data key="d0">Farm to School Program</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A program that connects schools with local farms to serve healthy, local foods in cafeterias, provide hands-on learning like school gardens, and offer nutrition education. The text highlights its benefits for farmers, students, and school food services, and provides a step-by-step guide on how to start one.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04be01c6169d0bdd92b10dca615a3936</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
    <node id="National Farm to School Network">
      <data key="d0">National Farm to School Network</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The National Farm to School Network is a national advocacy organization formed in 2007 that works to improve student access to and knowledge of fresh, healthy food. It achieves this by connecting schools with local farms and supporting food-related curricula. The network supports Farm to School programs across the United States by offering resources, guidelines, and a network of experts to help schools establish and sustain their own programs, with its website being a primary source for research. Additionally, the organization is involved in evaluating these programs and co-authored the report "Bearing Fruit: Farm to School Program Evaluation Resources and Recommendations." ASAP's "Growing Minds" program serves as the network's Southeastern regional lead agency, and Debra Eshmeyer serves as the communications and outreach director.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-04be01c6169d0bdd92b10dca615a3936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c38b37fe24e15bfa43a713c9e38509&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0dfef7989eab5ae8b58770f9786cac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062d9ac74f75199c91576d982ab5a9f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79fcf59d7b63a10ed28124a2923fc0f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6eed415e2d01ca41ab07d4cac89623</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
