      <data key="d2">Grass Valley, California is the location of Peaceful Valley Farm Supply.&lt;SEP&gt;The city and state where Peaceful Valley Farm &amp; Garden Supply is located.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9c07830327394a77dc9e8ac1a53acd63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57c24510274e9c9fcb046e6b604285fd</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
