      <data key="d0">South Carolina</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">"The state where the food distributor Carolina Produce is located, adjacent to the North Carolina region served by the Growing Minds program."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A state in the Southern Appalachian region that is included within the 100-mile 'local' definition established by ASAP.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ba841e41630d5b5e46b271cb1a11d579&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc6eed415e2d01ca41ab07d4cac89623</data>
