      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A super-motivated, highly educated volunteer base at Abernethy Elementary. One parent in particular initiated the push for a school garden and fresh food kitchen, even working in it themselves, highlighting their crucial role in the program's success."&gt;</data>
