      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A critical group of school employees who prepare and handle food. The text emphasizes the importance of getting them excited about local food through initiatives like farm tours and CSA shares to ensure their buy-in and manage the extra work of fresh food preparation."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-59c16ea96bc625614680cc6d8276e6ca</data>
