      <data key="d0">Local Farmers</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"The producers of fresh, local food that are the essential suppliers in the Farm to School initiative. The text describes strategies for connecting them to school markets and building relationships between them and school staff."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A beneficiary group of the cooperative model. An expanded 30-restaurant cooperative is projected to spend about 75% of its $2 million annual budget with local farmers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c9f558ccef1d0a97c2f1550636dc3f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c16ea96bc625614680cc6d8276e6ca</data>
