      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"The School District is the governing body for Abernethy and other schools. It initially raised concerns about the fairness and cost of Abernethy's program but agreed to designate it as a pilot kitchen after mediation."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472</data>
