    <node id="Harvest of the Month">
      <data key="d0">Harvest of the Month</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Harvest of the Month is a recurring educational program at Abernethy where a specific fruit or vegetable grown in Oregon is featured in the curriculum and school lunches to familiarize children with local, fresh produce."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A recurring event in a school cafeteria where students are given samples of produce, such as Brussels sprouts, and recipes to take home, aimed at promoting healthy eating.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0a7be9460651dfa3f1395f006df3ef8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472</data>
