      <data key="d0">Sarah Sullivan</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"Sarah Sullivan is the coordinator of Abernethy's garden curriculum and the AmeriCorps garden teacher. Her position is funded by the PTA, and she focuses on curriculum development, grant writing, and systemic change."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A representative of Abernethy Elementary School in Portland, OR.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8d3d51c80e398fde0d7a70a89888fa0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472</data>
