      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"The Parent-Teacher Association (PTA) at Abernethy is a highly active and influential group that provides essential funding for the garden curriculum coordinator (Sarah Sullivan) and the AmeriCorps garden teacher position."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
