      <data key="d0">Abernethy's Garden Curriculum</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">"Abernethy's Garden Curriculum is a hands-on educational program that integrates subjects like math, science, and art with practical gardening. It is teacher-approved, aligned with state standards, and involves all students for an hour each week."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5a81765c57d711272f41bff8f406f472</data>
