      <data key="d0">Youth Grow</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Youth Grow is an initiative of the 'Growing Gardens' organization. It focuses on developing school gardening programs to improve nutrition and teach children about food origins and cultivation through hands-on activities.</data>
