      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual mentioned in the index.&lt;SEP&gt;Page Allison is the co-founder of the Jones Valley Urban Farm, alongside Edwin Marty. She also completed an apprenticeship in agroecology at the University of California at Santa Cruz before returning to Birmingham.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9297eb734555e7b850045590e4fc5cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73</data>
