    </node>
    <node id="The Arts and Science of Agriculture (ASAP)">
      <data key="d0">The Arts and Science of Agriculture (ASAP)</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">ASAP is an interdisciplinary science course and program developed by JVUF for high school students. It combines academic study of subjects like botany and soil chemistry with hands-on farming experience. Its popularity led to the creation of a summer internship program for its graduates.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
