    <node id="Bryding Adams">
      <data key="d0">Bryding Adams</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Bryding Adams is a board member for Jones Valley Urban Farm (JVUF) and a representative for Kelly Elementary School. He has commented on the popularity of the ASAP course among math and science students at ASFA, noting that it is a form of applied science.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0809b82d4ca6415545d8263dbdcfcf73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-062d9ac74f75199c91576d982ab5a9f4</data>
