    <node id="Marty">
      <data key="d0">Marty</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A key figure associated with both the Obesity Task Force and JVUF in Birmingham. He advocates for nutrition training for cafeteria staff and expresses high hopes for changing the food system through the 'Farm to School' initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;Marty is a key figure associated with JVUF who advocates for systemic changes in school food systems in Birmingham. He was instrumental in the campaign to remove fryers from all schools and believes training cafeteria staff is the next step.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740848</data>
    </node>
