    <node id="Obesity Task Force">
      <data key="d0">Obesity Task Force</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An organization in Birmingham that implemented a strategy to improve school food. In 2009, it conducted a pilot nutrition training program for cafeteria staff to encourage the use of fresh foods and reduce fat and salt.&lt;SEP&gt;The Obesity Task Force is a citizen-led group in Jefferson County, in which JVUF is a core partner. It was authorized by the Department of Health to lead efforts against childhood obesity and successfully campaigned to have fryers removed from Birmingham schools.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740849</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Jefferson County Department of Health">
      <data key="d0">Jefferson County Department of Health</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The Jefferson County Department of Health is a government body that authorized the local Obesity Task Force to lead and coordinate efforts to combat childhood obesity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1753740849</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Jamie Oliver">
      <data key="d0">Jamie Oliver</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">"A British celebrity chef and food activist known for his global campaigns to improve school lunches and promote healthier eating habits."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Jamie Oliver is a celebrity chef known for his TV show 'The Food Revolution'. His work is cited as an example that highlights the poor quality of school food and the difficulty of enacting change, reinforcing the importance of JVUF's mission.&lt;SEP&gt;Jamie Oliver is the creator of the 'Food Revolution' documentary project, for which Debra Eshmeyer was a consultant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-062d9ac74f75199c91576d982ab5a9f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60121fd34d6b068a55f53ef625e1f266&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
