    </node>
    <node id="Growing Together">
      <data key="d0">Growing Together</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">'Growing Together' is a training series created by JVUF to teach community members how to develop and sustain their own community gardens. The program was highly successful, attracting 87 graduates in its first run.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6c15e66cc3147bff35c99fe3e874a056</data>
