    <node id="Maine">
      <data key="d0">Maine</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Maine is a U.S. state located on the East Coast and is mentioned as a location for operating Community Supported Fisheries (CSFs), including the Maple Ridge Farm and Fishery. The state is home to the Maine Organic Farmers and Gardeners Association, an organization focused on promoting organic practices. Maine is also where one of the Northeast Organic Wheat consortium's teams is located. Bates College is located in Maine and dedicates a significant portion of its dining budget to sourcing local food.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9e716e5bd5f06009e0468b77709b834d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4725469cd4458c0f5eeeefdfccd30dd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7a0cfcfab5c2708055ae5c22dacee5f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80590371c3ba416132df035a1f48358</data>
