      <data key="d0">Machinery And Equipment</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A category covering farm tools and vehicles, including tractors. The index mentions evaluating equipment as a resource, providing shelters for it, and maintaining it during winter.&lt;SEP&gt;Machinery and equipment are tools used in farming. The text details acquisition options, costs, care, requirements, and different types like hand tools and small motors.</data>
