    <node id="Campus Sustainability">
      <data key="d0">Campus Sustainability</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A key goal for educational institutions, where purchasing local food is considered an integral strategy to build resilience against economic shifts, such as rising oil prices, and promote environmental responsibility.&lt;SEP&gt;A major movement on college campuses that serves as the primary driver for food system changes like the Farm to College movement. It aims to integrate sustainability into all aspects of campus life, including operations, teaching, and research.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80590371c3ba416132df035a1f48358</data>
