    <node id="Talloires Declaration">
      <data key="d0">Talloires Declaration</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A 10-point action plan developed in 1990 at a conference in France to integrate sustainability into campus life. It served as a foundational document that helped the campus sustainability movement gain momentum.&lt;SEP&gt;A declaration for sustainability in higher education, created by the organization University Leaders for a Sustainable Future. It serves as a guiding document for universities.&lt;SEP&gt;An international declaration for sustainability, created by and for university presidents and chancellors, signifying a commitment to environmental literacy in education.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38c9174dd4002f6529026fc7fd3c23f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c575c019780e689390cd685c690159f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467</data>
