      <data key="d0">Sustainable Campus Charter</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of core principles for a sustainable campus, which was signed by several Ivy League universities to set a standard for sustainability in higher education.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of three core principles for a sustainable campus articulated in 2010. It set a new standard for sustainability in higher education, with several Ivy League universities as early signatories.&lt;SEP&gt;An initiative or formal agreement adopted by educational institutions to commit to sustainability principles and practices on their campuses.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-38c9174dd4002f6529026fc7fd3c23f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba8e532ec9e7db3fd3049537a06db80</data>
