      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A group of food service workers in institutions like schools and universities. The text highlights their crucial role in food system change, detailing their initial training with 'commodity food' and subsequent retraining through programs by the Obesity Task Force and JVUF to handle fresh, local ingredients.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d971c6976ab8e71370d85b346b00f467</data>
