      <data key="d2">An Ivy League university that was an early signatory of the Sustainable Campus Charter. It is noted for its acclaimed Yale Sustainable Food Project, which was initiated after a request from parent and chef Alice Waters and has since expanded to include a farm and academic programs.</data>
