      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An Ivy League university and signatory of the Sustainable Campus Charter. In 2002, it launched its Community Harvest program for sustainable food purchasing in response to student requests. The university provided a critical contract to the local dairy co-op, Rhody Fresh.</data>
