      <data key="d0">Berkeley College (Yale)</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An undergraduate residential college at Yale University where the sustainable food initiative began, at the request of Alice Waters whose daughter was enrolled there. Its dining hall became a model for the entire campus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7ba8e532ec9e7db3fd3049537a06db80</data>
