      <data key="d0">Chicago Tribune</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A newspaper that conducted an interview with a co-op representative regarding the positive impact of the Brown contract.&lt;SEP&gt;A newspaper that interviewed Louis Escobar, president of the Rhody Fresh co-op, about the positive impact of the Brown University contract.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chicago Tribune is a newspaper that published an article by Andrew Martin about local foods in college cafeterias.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a80590371c3ba416132df035a1f48358&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c575c019780e689390cd685c690159f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ba8e532ec9e7db3fd3049537a06db80</data>
