    <node id="Brown">
      <data key="d0">Brown</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Brown refers to Brown University, which is connected to the George Street Journal and the Brown Alumni Magazine, and has a 'Brown Is Green' initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;Refers to Brown University, which is cited as a well-known example of a college working towards food sustainability through contracts with local food providers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8c575c019780e689390cd685c690159f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80590371c3ba416132df035a1f48358</data>
