    <node id="Local Meat-Processing And Storage Facilities">
      <data key="d0">Local Meat-Processing And Storage Facilities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A critical piece of infrastructure whose absence is cited as the biggest challenge to scaling up the local food system in the Flagstaff area. The complexity of state and federal inspection makes establishing them difficult.</data>
