      <data key="d2">"A representative for Forage Oakland."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;Founder of Forage Oakland, who started a fruit-bartering system in 2008 to build neighborhood relationships and reduce food waste.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347d33c4b812366f78a72782c922f5f8</data>
