      <data key="d0">Forage Oakland</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">"An organization whose representative is Asiya Wadud. Its name suggests a location in Oakland."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;A grassroots organization in Oakland, California, founded by Asiya Wadud. It facilitates a fruit-bartering system among neighbors to utilize surplus fruit from residential trees.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347d33c4b812366f78a72782c922f5f8</data>
