    </node>
    <node id="Solid Ground">
      <data key="d0">Solid Ground</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A nonprofit community development organization based in Seattle that published the guide '_Gather It! How to Organize an Urban Fruit Harvest_', which is described as the 'bible for foraging and gleaning'.&lt;SEP&gt;An antipoverty nonprofit based in Seattle, Washington, that operates a sophisticated fruit-gleaning program called Community Fruit Tree Harvest.&lt;SEP&gt;Solid Ground is an antipoverty nonprofit organization based in Seattle, Washington. It runs a sophisticated fruit-gleaning program called Community Fruit Tree Harvest, which gathered nearly 20,000 pounds of fruit in 2009 for food banks.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6db795582f52e35a0bb9aea86e66f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d3d51c80e398fde0d7a70a89888fa0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347d33c4b812366f78a72782c922f5f8</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
