    <node id="Community Fruit Tree Harvest">
      <data key="d0">Community Fruit Tree Harvest</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A sophisticated and finely tuned fruit-gleaning program operated by the nonprofit organization Solid Ground in Seattle, Washington.&lt;SEP&gt;Community Fruit Tree Harvest is an ongoing fruit-gleaning program organized by the nonprofit Solid Ground in Seattle. Volunteers collect fruit from private yards to be given to food banks, composted, or taken home, with the goal of reducing waste and feeding the hungry.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6db795582f52e35a0bb9aea86e66f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-347d33c4b812366f78a72782c922f5f8</data>
