      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wadud is a person who articulates a philosophy on gleaning, emphasizing that one should request permission before taking fruit from a homeowner's property to build community trust and awareness of local food resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6db795582f52e35a0bb9aea86e66f7f</data>
