      <data key="d2">An individual quoted in the Marin Independent Journal in an article about a 'gleaners' program.&lt;SEP&gt;Helge Hellberg is the former director of Marin Organic. He championed the gleaning program, explaining its economic benefits for both schools and farmers, and noted its role as a model for other communities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d6db795582f52e35a0bb9aea86e66f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ffa8b612642fa385d2af41e902aa75d</data>
