      <data key="d0">National Gleaning Day</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">National Gleaning Day is an awareness event founded by Marin Organic on September 20, 2010, to promote the practice of gleaning nationwide.&lt;SEP&gt;National Gleaning Day is an event founded by Marin Organic on September 20, 2010. It is designed to encourage communities, farms, and schools across the nation to glean healthy food for children.</data>
