    <edge source="Beekeeping" target="Honey">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A potential outcome for beekeepers is the ability to harvest and sell surplus honey, which can help offset the costs of the hobby, though this is not guaranteed, especially in the first few years.&lt;SEP&gt;Honey is described as one of the main benefits and tangible returns of the endeavor of Beekeeping.&lt;SEP&gt;Honey is the primary product and crop that results from the practice of beekeeping.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural output,benefit,economic incentive,harvesting,motivation,primary product,product</data>
