    <edge source="Beekeeping" target="Beekeeper">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A Beekeeper is a person who actively engages in the practice of Beekeeping. The text establishes that the success of the endeavor is directly proportional to the commitment and knowledge of the beekeeper.&lt;SEP&gt;The beekeeper is the practitioner of beekeeping, and the text emphasizes that they must continuously learn and engage with the broader beekeeping world to succeed.</data>
      <data key="d8">commitment,community engagement,endeavor,practitioner,practitioner role,skill development</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-60575ab4028f754c314fcbcee392db85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0385df8773cab416fd9b294da95cf91d</data>
