    <edge source="Swarming" target="Nectar Flow">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Nectar Flow is one of the primary environmental triggers that, in combination with other factors, signals to a colony that conditions are right to initiate swarming.</data>
      <data key="d8">behavioral signal,causal factor,environmental trigger</data>
