      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Swarming" target="Queen Cells">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The timing of the swarm's departure is directly linked to the development stage of the Queen Cells; the swarm typically leaves on the day the first queen cell is capped.</data>
      <data key="d8">biological trigger,event coordination,timing</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee196747c63e46006af016f7f2104f8d</data>
