    </edge>
    <edge source="Swarming" target="Swarming Impulse">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Swarming Impulse is the irresistible drive that causes a colony to swarm. The act of swarming is the fulfillment of this impulse.</data>
      <data key="d8">behavioral driver,cause and effect,instinct</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee196747c63e46006af016f7f2104f8d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Swarming" target="New Colony">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The New Colony is the direct result of the Swarming event, as it is composed of the bees and queen that left the original hive.</data>
      <data key="d8">colony creation,outcome,propagation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee196747c63e46006af016f7f2104f8d</data>
