    </edge>
    <edge source="Swarming" target="Honey">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The event of swarming can cause honey production for the season to be severely reduced or lost altogether.</data>
      <data key="d8">production loss,resource impact</data>
