    <edge source="Parasitic Mites" target="Apiary Inspection Program">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Apiary inspection programs are responsible for helping to control the spread of parasitic mites, which are a severe and growing problem for bee colonies.</data>
