      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Parasitic Mites" target="Importation Ban Of Live Bees">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text theorizes that the introduction of parasitic mites into North America was a direct result of someone illegally violating the federal ban on importing live bees.</data>
      <data key="d8">invasive species introduction,regulation violation</data>
