    </edge>
    <edge source="Pesticides" target="Colony Collapse Disorder (CCD)">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The increased use of pesticides is suggested in the text as one of the potential causes of Colony Collapse Disorder in honeybee colonies.</data>
      <data key="d8">causal factor,environmental stress</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-27bb80a716045bb643a01fd3aae1d84b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740880</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Honey" target="Comb Honey">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Comb honey is a specific form of the honey product, distinguished by being presented in its natural wax comb.</data>
      <data key="d8">product form,sub-type</data>
