      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Comb Honey" target="Extracted Honey">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text contrasts comb honey and extracted honey as two different production goals, strongly recommending that beginners focus on the less complex extracted honey and avoid the difficulties associated with producing comb honey.</data>
      <data key="d8">beekeeping strategy,difficulty level,product comparison</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-da9216023ced68a9aa545d43ca1d419f</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Comb Honey" target="Beekeepers">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text advises beginner beekeepers against attempting to produce comb honey due to its complexity and high chance of failure, though it offers a low-risk method for trying to obtain a small amount.</data>
      <data key="d8">expert advice,production difficulty,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-da9216023ced68a9aa545d43ca1d419f</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
