    <edge source="Comb Honey" target="Propolis">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Propolis is identified as a potential contaminant that can become a problem in comb honey, especially if produced late in the season, affecting its quality and enjoyability.</data>
      <data key="d8">contamination,product quality,production challenge</data>
