    <edge source="Beekeeper" target="Beekeeper Organizations">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text strongly advises that a Beekeeper should join Beekeeper Organizations to stay connected with a support network, gain knowledge, and keep up with a dynamic field.</data>
      <data key="d8">community support,information network,professional development</data>
