    </edge>
    <edge source="Beekeeper" target="Beekeeper's Commitment">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text defines a successful beekeeper as one who has a strong commitment to learning about and working with their bees, which is a central theme of the document.</data>
      <data key="d8">dedication,practitioner attribute,success factor</data>
