      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Beekeeper" target="Beekeeping Knowledge">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A beekeeper's success is directly tied to their acquisition and continuous updating of Beekeeping Knowledge, as the field is dynamic and problems constantly arise.</data>
      <data key="d8">continuous learning,professional development,required competency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-60575ab4028f754c314fcbcee392db85</data>
