      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Universities" target="Farmer">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Universities have a vested interest in the definition of a 'farmer' because the number of farmers in a state affects the amount of federal funding their programs receive.</data>
      <data key="d8">academic debate,financial incentive</data>
