    </edge>
    <edge source="Universities" target="Niche Marketing">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The principle of niche marketing is presented as an alternative and more effective strategy for small farmers compared to the traditional, large-scale-favoring methods promoted by universities.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural strategy,contrasting philosophies</data>
