      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bee Havers" target="Bees">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Bee Havers are defined by their passive relationship with bees; they 'have' them but do not actively 'keep' or care for them, letting the bees fend for themselves.</data>
      <data key="d8">irresponsible practice,neglect,passive ownership</data>
