    </edge>
    <edge source="New Beekeeper" target="Foundation">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text assumes that a New Beekeeper is typically dealing with foundation in their supers, which presents the challenge of getting the bees to draw it into comb.</data>
