    </edge>
    <edge source="Predators" target="Poultry">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Poultry are described as being particularly in need of protection from various predators like coyotes and owls.&lt;SEP&gt;The text explicitly links poultry to predators by noting the need for shelters to protect them.</data>
      <data key="d8">animal safety,farm security,predator-prey,threat</data>
