      <data key="d11">1753740870</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Predators" target="Animal Shelters">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A primary function of animal shelters is to protect livestock from predators, which is mentioned as being essential.</data>
