    <edge source="Western Hemisphere" target="Small Farm">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The foreword places the concept of the farm in a deep historical context by noting that agriculture has existed in the Western Hemisphere for generations, long before European settlement.</data>
