    <edge source="Beeswax Foundation" target="Beeswax">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A large amount of beeswax is recycled to create beeswax foundation, a product used back inside the hives, demonstrating a circular use of the material in beekeeping.</data>
      <data key="d8">beekeeping supplies,product lifecycle,recycling</data>
