    </edge>
    <edge source="Honey Bee Colony" target="Brood Rearing">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Brood rearing is a fundamental need and activity of the colony to ensure its population continues, though it may be reduced or stopped during winter.</data>
