    </edge>
    <edge source="Honey Bee Colony" target="Annual Population Cycle">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The annual population cycle is the defining yearly pattern of life, growth, and decline for an established honey bee colony.</data>
      <data key="d8">life cycle,population dynamics</data>
