    <edge source="Egg" target="Larva">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The egg hatches after 3 days to become a larva, which is the next stage in the honey bee life cycle.</data>
      <data key="d8">development,life cycle,metamorphosis</data>
