    <edge source="Larva" target="Cocoon">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A honey bee larva spins a cocoon to protect itself as it transitions into the pupal stage.</data>
      <data key="d8">life cycle,metamorphosis,protection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b9bf03b457112a6e1094db904efcfe2d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pupa" target="Cocoon">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The pupal stage of development occurs entirely within the cocoon that was spun by the larva.</data>
