    <edge source="Brood" target="Nurse Bees">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Nurse Bees are responsible for caring for the Brood and will not abandon it, a behavior that directly impacts honey harvesting methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Nurse bees are directly responsible for the survival of the brood, as their main function is to feed them.</data>
      <data key="d8">behavioral relationship,caregiving,dependency,life cycle</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-65de87b95deadb72c4827d5a3bd2f316&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92090c6a7f40e420c9b8e4d961a9a21b</data>
