    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Queen">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The queen's performance and health are directly evaluated by the quality and pattern of the brood she produces. A poor brood pattern is a primary reason for replacing a queen."&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;The Queen is responsible for producing the Brood by laying eggs. The presence of Brood is the ultimate proof of a healthy, functioning Queen.</data>
      <data key="d8">colony growth,performance metric,reproduction,reproductive health,verification</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-59970fe46f1c3b11508247730ae6145d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ff7d8f22cb1bb72cdb48f20d4975e8d</data>
