      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Hive Inspection">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">During a hive inspection, the most critical task is to search for brood (eggs and larvae), as this serves as direct evidence that the colony has a functioning queen and is developing properly.</data>
      <data key="d8">core task,health indicator,verification</data>
