      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Winter Cluster">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Winter Cluster must remain large enough to physically cover the Brood. If the cluster contracts too much due to extreme cold, the exposed brood will chill and die, impacting the colony's future.</data>
      <data key="d8">brood care,protection,thermoregulation</data>
