    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Fall Requeening">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Fall requeening is performed to solve problems like a poor brood pattern and to stimulate the production of a new young brood, which strengthens the colony's population for winter."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">colony health,population boost</data>
