    <edge source="Brood" target="American Foulbrood (AFB)">
      <data key="d6">29.0</data>
      <data key="d7">American Foulbrood is listed as a disease that affects honey bee brood.&lt;SEP&gt;The glossary defines American Foulbrood as a disease that specifically infects the brood stage of honey bees.&lt;SEP&gt;The text explicitly states that American Foulbrood is a disease that affects only the Brood of a honey bee colony, specifically killing the larvae.</data>
      <data key="d8">brood disease,disease,disease target,host specificity,host-pathogen,infection,pathology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6550c1217ac242a6cb1c3d9a5de5ee35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ca632d7241d4efd7901ef6c477cffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-850b95b5ab1cf1d4aef287383ef1ecfe</data>
