      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Spores">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The spores of AFB are carried in brood food and directly infect the bee larvae (Brood), germinating in their gut and causing death.</data>
