    </edge>
    <edge source="Brood" target="Terramycin">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Terramycin's primary function is to enable the Brood to withstand infection from AFB spores, rather than killing the spores themselves.</data>
      <data key="d8">disease resistance,medication target,protective effect</data>
