    <edge source="Brood" target="European Foulbrood (EFB)">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">European Foulbrood is a bacterial disease that infects and kills honey bee brood.&lt;SEP&gt;The glossary defines European Foulbrood as a disease that specifically infects the brood stage of honey bees.</data>
      <data key="d8">disease,host-pathogen,infection,pathology</data>
