    <edge source="Brood" target="Chalkbrood">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Chalkbrood is a fungal disease that specifically infects the brood of a honey bee colony.&lt;SEP&gt;The glossary defines Chalkbrood as a fungal infection that can infect honey bee brood.</data>
      <data key="d8">disease,host-pathogen,infection,pathology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6550c1217ac242a6cb1c3d9a5de5ee35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13ca632d7241d4efd7901ef6c477cffc</data>
