    <edge source="Nectar" target="Foraging">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Nectar is one of the primary resources collected by honey bees during foraging.&lt;SEP&gt;Nectar is one of the primary resources collected from flowers during foraging activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary objective of the Foraging event is to locate and collect the highest quality Nectar from flowers, as its value is crucial to the colony's economy.</data>
      <data key="d8">economic value,food source,objective,resource collection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee2dbfbb5c1a5664034bad31b4143c62&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c389aa55b6d5b4c773f2c917b36e7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f51ec44f0c17ad5253b21395cf12591</data>
