    </edge>
    <edge source="Foraging" target="Bee Colony">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Foraging is a crucial collective activity undertaken by the Bee Colony to ensure its economic well-being and survival by efficiently gathering necessary resources like nectar.&lt;SEP&gt;Foraging is a primary activity of the Bee Colony during the active season, which ceases entirely during winter.</data>
      <data key="d8">colony activity,resource gathering,seasonal activity,survival</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-96d3190b056360cfac9d6ae0c079078e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f51ec44f0c17ad5253b21395cf12591</data>
