      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Foraging" target="Scout Bee">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Scout Bees play a pioneering role in the Foraging process by actively searching for and identifying new, superior resource sources, thereby directing the colony's collective foraging efforts.</data>
      <data key="d8">exploration,resource discovery,specialization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6f51ec44f0c17ad5253b21395cf12591</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Foraging" target="Forager Bee">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Forager Bees are the primary agents that carry out the event of Foraging, leaving the hive to collect resources from the environment.</data>
      <data key="d8">agent of action,resource collection,role</data>
