    </edge>
    <edge source="Foraging" target="ForageSF">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">ForageSF is an advocacy group whose entire mission is to promote, teach, and commercialize the practice of foraging.&lt;SEP&gt;The core mission of ForageSF is to promote and educate people about foraging for wild foods through various organized activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">advocacy,core mission,education,educational program,promotion</data>
