    <edge source="Brood Nest" target="Queen">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The quality of the queen directly determines the health and pattern of the brood nest. A 'nice tight brood pattern' signifies a good queen, while a poor one may require her replacement.</data>
