    <edge source="Bee Behavior" target="Physiological Development">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A bee's behavior is directly dependent on its physiological development. For example, the ability and inclination to sting only emerge after its venom glands are fully functional about two weeks into its adult life.</data>
