    <edge source="Bee Behavior" target="External Factors">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Bee behavior is significantly shaped by reactions to external factors such as odor, light, heat, and vibration. The text highlights that these stimuli are key to interpreting and controlling bee activities, such as using smoke to calm a colony.</data>
