    <edge source="Bee Behavior" target="Anthropomorphism">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Anthropomorphism is presented as a method for interpreting and discussing bee behavior in human terms. The text cautions that while it can be a handy tool, it often leads to inaccurate interpretations, such as labeling a colony 'mean'.</data>
