    <edge source="The South" target="Ants">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text explicitly states that while ants are often not a problem, specific species in 'the South' are a serious threat to bee colonies.&lt;SEP&gt;The text specifically identifies the South as a geographical region where ants pose a particularly serious threat to bee colonies.</data>
