    </edge>
    <edge source="New Colony" target="The First Inspection">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The First Inspection is a critical management step performed on the New Colony to check its status and ensure the queen's well-being.</data>
      <data key="d8">colony management,health check</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6706ffd7485284387c77b1f38a66ce9c</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="New Colony" target="Package Installation">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Package Installation is the specific event that marks the creation of the New Colony by placing the bees into their hive.</data>
      <data key="d8">creation event,hive establishment</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6706ffd7485284387c77b1f38a66ce9c</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="New Colony" target="Comb">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The New Colony must build Comb as a fundamental activity for survival, enabling food storage and brood rearing.</data>
      <data key="d8">construction,infrastructure,survival</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6706ffd7485284387c77b1f38a66ce9c</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="New Colony" target="Colony Population Decline">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The New Colony inevitably experiences a Colony Population Decline in its first month, which is a critical challenge it must overcome.</data>
      <data key="d8">challenge,life cycle,population dynamics</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6706ffd7485284387c77b1f38a66ce9c</data>
