      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="New Colony" target="Surplus Honey Crop">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A new colony is not expected to produce a significant surplus honey crop in its first year due to its smaller bee population.</data>
      <data key="d8">colony maturity,production capacity,yield expectation</data>
