    <edge source="Novice Beekeeper" target="Bee Biology">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text advises the novice beekeeper to gain knowledge of bee biology to properly understand swarm control.</data>
      <data key="d8">beekeeping practice,education,learning requirement</data>
