    </edge>
    <edge source="Nutrition" target="Livestock">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text explains that the nutritional needs of livestock, especially multiple-birth animals like sheep and hogs, must be met with high-quality forage to support reproduction.</data>
      <data key="d8">animal husbandry,dietary needs</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-454a001b38f4bf2cba51915cb1f4804e</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
