    </edge>
    <edge source="Nutrition" target="Crops">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Different crops provide different nutritional values for livestock. Legumes are cited as having higher protein content than grasses.</data>
      <data key="d8">feed value,forage quality</data>
