      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740875</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Winter" target="Farm Equipment">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">During the winter, farm equipment must either be fully winterized for storage or run periodically at low speed to maintain lubrication of internal parts.</data>
      <data key="d8">equipment storage,operational procedure,seasonal maintenance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d2c2f40ce23609da02bb09b06c26efd7</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740880</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Winter" target="Feeder Pigs">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The timing of slaughter for the Feeder Pigs is determined by the onset of Winter. They are slaughtered beforehand to eliminate the high cost and labor of feeding them through the coldest months.</data>
      <data key="d8">cost avoidance,livestock cycle,seasonal management</data>
