    <edge source="Water" target="Crops">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text explains that the growth, nutrient value, and survival of crops are fundamentally dependent on water for processes like photosynthesis and nutrient absorption from the soil.&lt;SEP&gt;The text explicitly details the significant water requirements for various crops, providing a data table and stating that water availability is a deciding factor in crop selection.&lt;SEP&gt;The text states that rain and snow provide free water for crops, a fundamental requirement for their growth.</data>
