    </edge>
    <edge source="Dancer" target="Hivemates">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The dancer communicates information to the hivemates, who follow her, touch her, and interpret the dance to understand the location and quality of resources.</data>
      <data key="d8">information transfer,social communication</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3ca6767b0793c7530226a6b224d0f21b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Dancer" target="Comb">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The comb serves as the physical stage for the bee's dance. The dancer performs her movements on the comb, using its vertical axis as a symbolic representation for the direction of the sun.</data>
      <data key="d8">performance location,symbolic reference</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3ca6767b0793c7530226a6b224d0f21b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sun" target="Comb">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The abstract direction of the sun is symbolically translated onto a physical object, the comb, where a vertical line represents the sun's direction, enabling navigation instructions inside the dark hive.</data>
      <data key="d8">navigational translation,symbolic representation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3ca6767b0793c7530226a6b224d0f21b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sun" target="Hive Location">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The selection of a Hive Location should consider the amount of Sun, as bees prefer a balance of sun and shade, avoiding locations with too much or too little sunlight.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental factors,habitat preference</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-048ad5fead1e52a66cfd2e40b5467d7b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sun" target="Free Energy Sources">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The sun is listed as the first and a major example of a free energy source for a farm.</data>
      <data key="d8">energy source,example,resource</data>
