      <data key="d11">1753740861</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Comb" target="Diseases">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text establishes a direct link between comb and disease transmission, stating that colonies with comb may contain disease organisms, whereas those without have a minimized risk.</data>
      <data key="d8">disease vector,risk factor</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-18646221e86ea90ee41e4d859e5ef7b1</data>
