      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Comb" target="Wax Moths">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Wax moth larvae burrow through and feed on the comb, leaving behind webbing and frass that destroys the comb's structure, making it a primary target of destruction.</data>
      <data key="d8">destruction,hive damage</data>
