      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740503</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Food" target="Goats">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The article explicitly links the utility of goats for land clearing to their increased economic viability and potential as a mainstream food source in the form of goat meat.</data>
      <data key="d8">economic linkage,food system</data>
