    </edge>
    <edge source="Complete Two-Story Hive" target="Hive Bodies">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Hive Bodies are the main structural boxes that make up a Complete Two-Story Hive; the text specifies that two are needed for this configuration.</data>
      <data key="d8">hive component,structural part</data>
