    </edge>
    <edge source="Complete Two-Story Hive" target="Inner Cover">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Inner Cover is a necessary component of a Complete Two-Story Hive, placed between the top box and the outer cover.</data>
      <data key="d8">hive component,structural part</data>
