      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Food Project intentionally recruits 40% of its teen workers from the suburbs to create a diverse and transformative environment for all participants.</data>
      <data key="d8">diversity,recruitment strategy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b688540c900515c3ef10df531de83587</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Suburbs" target="Teens">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">40% of the teens participating in The Food Project's program are from the suburbs, a key part of the organization's diversity strategy.</data>
      <data key="d8">demographics,origin</data>
