    <edge source="Standard Equipment" target="Eight-frame Units">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Eight-frame Units are presented as a non-standard alternative to the more common ten-frame Standard Equipment, and beginners are advised to avoid them.</data>
      <data key="d8">equipment comparison,non-standard alternative</data>
