    </edge>
    <edge source="Standard Equipment" target="Eleven-frame Units">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Eleven-frame Units are cited as a less common alternative to Standard Equipment, which beginners should avoid in favor of the more widely used ten-frame configuration.</data>
      <data key="d8">equipment comparison,non-standard alternative</data>
