    </edge>
    <edge source="Frames" target="Plastic">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Plastic is an alternative material for frames, which the author finds less satisfactory and more fragile than wood when used with a hive tool.</data>
      <data key="d8">equipment choice,material composition,material weakness</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-91fddbed5da654e2156cc50a2222b4ed</data>
