    <edge source="Frames" target="Installing A Package Of Bees">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The process of installing a package of bees explicitly requires the removal and subsequent replacement of several frames to create space.</data>
      <data key="d8">hive preparation,process step</data>
