    </edge>
    <edge source="Sugar Syrup" target="Pollen Patties">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Sugar syrup is the liquid binder mixed with pollen substitute to form the dough for pollen patties.</data>
      <data key="d8">food preparation,ingredient</data>
