    <edge source="Weather" target="Farm Plan">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text identifies Weather as a primary variable that a robust Farm Plan must account for and devise strategies to mitigate, such as using cover crops or irrigation.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental factors,risk management,strategic planning</data>
