    </edge>
    <edge source="Weather" target="Drip Irrigation">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Drip irrigation is presented as a specific strategy to counter the negative effects of weather, particularly water-related issues.</data>
      <data key="d8">problem mitigation,risk reduction,water management</data>
