    <edge source="Fall Management" target="August">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text indicates that Fall Management, despite its name, can begin in August, showing that the timing is dictated by the colony's needs, not the calendar.</data>
      <data key="d8">management schedule,seasonal timing</data>
