      <data key="d11">1753740472</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Winter Cluster" target="Food Stores">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Winter Cluster consumes Food Stores (honey) to generate heat. If the cluster becomes too small and cold, it may lose contact with its food supply and starve, even if honey is nearby.</data>
      <data key="d8">energy consumption,resource dependency,survival</data>
