    <edge source="Food Stores" target="Fall Feeding">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Fall feeding is the direct remedy for a lack of sufficient food stores. The goal of feeding is to increase the hive's stored food to the level required for winter survival."&gt;</data>
