      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Miticur is a contact miticide applied in hives to kill tracheal mites and control infestations.&lt;SEP&gt;Miticur is an effective treatment for tracheal mites, and the text explicitly states that using it against either Varroa or tracheal mites protects the colony from the other.</data>
