    <edge source="Bottom Board Inserts" target="Varroa Mite">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Bottom board inserts are a primary tool used to detect and inspect for Varroa mites, by catching mites that fall to the bottom of the hive after a treatment.</data>
