    <edge source="Wax Moths" target="Paradichlorobenzine (PDB)">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Paradichlorobenzine (PDB) is recommended as a chemical agent to protect stored equipment from damage caused by wax moths.&lt;SEP&gt;Wax moths are the target pest for the chemical treatment PDB, which is used to protect empty beekeeping equipment during storage.</data>
