    </edge>
    <edge source="Wax Moths" target="Bee Brood">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The burrowing and webbing activity of wax moth larvae can cause maturing bee brood to become trapped in their cells and die before they can emerge as adults.</data>
