      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The _Apis mellifera scutellata_ subspecies was the subject of the experimental breeding program in Brazil, which aimed to study and utilize its characteristics.</data>
      <data key="d8">research subject,scientific study</data>
