    <edge source="Africanized Bees" target="European Bees">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Africanized bees are a crossbreed of African and European bees. Their behavior is consistently contrasted with that of the more docile European bees, with which they continue to interbreed as they spread.</data>
      <data key="d8">behavioral comparison,genetic mixing,interbreeding</data>
