    </edge>
    <edge source="Africanized Bees" target="Public Officials">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The arrival of Africanized bees necessitates action from public officials, who must create regulations. There is a risk that these officials, if not properly educated, could impose panic-driven restrictions on the beekeeping community.</data>
      <data key="d8">public policy,regulation,risk management</data>
