    <edge source="Corn" target="Nitrogen">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Corn is a crop that heavily uses nitrogen from the soil, leading to its depletion.&lt;SEP&gt;Corn is explicitly described as a nitrogen-using crop, which depletes soil nitrogen that must be replenished.</data>
