    </edge>
    <edge source="Corn" target="Hairy Vetch">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Hairy Vetch is seeded along with rye into a standing Corn crop as part of a short-term rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;The text describes a practice where hairy vetch is sown directly into a field of standing corn, showing a direct inter-planting relationship.</data>
      <data key="d8">cover cropping,crop cycle,crop sequence,inter-planting</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b6332789cdbd68f546cf7328c6217fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b320d4bf5bae3f28f4bca97246cd735</data>
