      <data key="d11">1753740867</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Corn" target="Soybeans">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A recommended rotation sequence is to follow nitrogen-fixing Soybeans with nitrogen-using Corn to manage soil nutrients effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The text recommends a crop rotation where nitrogen-fixing soybeans are followed by nitrogen-using corn to effectively manage soil nutrients.</data>
      <data key="d8">crop rotation,crop sequence,nutrient management,sustainable agriculture</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b6332789cdbd68f546cf7328c6217fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b320d4bf5bae3f28f4bca97246cd735</data>
