    <edge source="Corn" target="Hopi Culture">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Corn is depicted as the sacred center of Hopi Culture, integral to daily life, prayer, and ceremony. The text explicitly states 'Corn is life,' emphasizing its role as the primary source of physical and spiritual sustenance.</data>
