    <edge source="Corn" target="Traditional Hopi Farming">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Corn is the primary crop grown using the methods of Traditional Hopi Farming. The Honeyestewas' efforts, such as building fences and planting deep in the sandy soil, are focused on cultivating their corn crop.</data>
      <data key="d8">agriculture,cultivation,primary crop</data>
