    <edge source="Corn" target="Marie Honeyestewa">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Marie is a keeper of the family's sacred white corn, which she proudly displays, underscoring its central role in Hopi ceremony, prayer, and household life.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural stewardship,sacred item</data>
