      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Corn" target="Hopi">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Corn is described as the absolute center of Hopi life, being fundamental to their food, ceremonies, social structure, and spiritual identity. The fate of the corn and the people are inseparable.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural dependence,spiritual foundation,staple food</data>
