    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Making Your Small Farm Profitable">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The book 'Making Your Small Farm Profitable' is designed to teach farmers the concept of Agripreneurship, guiding them on how to turn their farm into a profitable business.&lt;SEP&gt;The book 'Making Your Small Farm Profitable' is fundamentally about the concept of Agripreneurship, teaching farmers how to apply its principles.</data>
      <data key="d8">business strategy,central theme,core concept,educational guide,guiding philosophy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3099841c9e59bebef5ddbb5acdb1e41</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740851</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Small Farms">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Agripreneurship is presented as the essential business philosophy that operators of small farms must adopt to become profitable and sustainable.</data>
      <data key="d8">business solution,profitability strategy,sustainability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740851</data>
    </edge>
