    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Sustainable Agriculture">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text hopes that by applying the principles of agripreneurship, farmers will move the industry toward a more consistently sustainable agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;The text presents the principles of sustainable agriculture and agripreneurship as related core concepts for modern farming operations.</data>
      <data key="d8">conceptual framework,farming philosophy,industry improvement,strategic goal,sustainability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ebf6866ed6ad144c3c4b844913be03e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef577d840302c2f3d95d7cb5a8f77433</data>
