    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Sustainable Farming">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Agripreneurship is explicitly defined as a practice that involves and requires Sustainable Farming. The text states that the guiding principle of agripreneurship is sustainability, which in turn requires profitability.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustainable farming is presented as a primary goal and principle of the agripreneurship model, which aims to make farms financially self-sufficient.</data>
      <data key="d8">core principle,guiding philosophy,guiding principle,operational goal</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157caea7b572636fefb27a23c9261c73</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740857</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Farming Life">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Agripreneurship is presented as the essential business framework needed to make the Farming Life successful and financially viable. It links the business, home, and family, and its principles are necessary to avoid losing the farm and home.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,lifestyle viability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740857</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Agripreneurship" target="Conventional Agriculture">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Agripreneurship is presented as a direct contrast to the model of Conventional Agriculture. While conventional farmers sell to middlemen, an agripreneur is responsible for their own sales and marketing, creating a more integrated business model.&lt;SEP&gt;The text defines agripreneurship by directly contrasting its direct-to-consumer, holistic business model with the middleman-dependent model of conventional agriculture.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model contrast,business philosophy,contrasting models,farming approach</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b11383420e2171e9a69799dbddd3b13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-157caea7b572636fefb27a23c9261c73</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740857</data>
    </edge>
