    <edge source="Small Farms" target="Agricultural County Agents">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Agricultural county agents, a traditional source of advice, are no longer a viable resource for most small farmers as they now only have time to serve full-time farmers.</data>
      <data key="d8">changing times,lack of support,resource scarcity</data>
