    <edge source="The Author" target="Farmer">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author proposes a simple, self-identifying definition: 'If you think you're a farmer, you are a farmer', which contrasts with the bureaucratic, numbers-based definitions from government agencies.</data>
      <data key="d8">personal definition,philosophical stance</data>
