    <edge source="The Author" target="Katahdin Hair sheep">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author raises Katahdin Hair sheep on their farm, valuing them as their most profitable livestock due to their efficiency in converting grass to profit.</data>
