    <edge source="The Author" target="Catfish">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The author successfully raised and sold 50-100 pounds of catfish per week, making it a core part of their business."&gt;_`business focus, product profitability`_&gt;</data>
