    <edge source="The Author" target="Katahdin Hair Sheep">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author personally raises Katahdin Hair sheep as a core part of his low-input, sustainable farming operation, citing their specific beneficial traits.&lt;SEP&gt;The author raises a flock of Katahdin Hair sheep, a specific breed chosen for its low-labor characteristics which fits into the farm's overall management plan.</data>
      <data key="d8">breed selection,farming system,livestock management,practical application</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ee261677ef65b4f0bf53fae46bfcfb75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8955ba3c4625c18d5ced8e174a4072e</data>
