    </edge>
    <edge source="The Author" target="Machinery">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author has a strong, defined philosophy on machinery, using it to compensate for his physical health limitations and increase productivity, while cautioning against buying it if it doesn't save time or labor.</data>
      <data key="d8">farming philosophy,labor-saving,physical adaptation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a8955ba3c4625c18d5ced8e174a4072e</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740880</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Author" target="Sustainable Agriculture">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author's entire farming practice, from his choice of livestock to his views on machinery, is an embodiment and advocacy of the principles of sustainable agriculture.</data>
      <data key="d8">farming philosophy,practical application</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a8955ba3c4625c18d5ced8e174a4072e</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740880</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Author" target="Ruth Stout">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author cites Ruth Stout and her 'no-work garden' technique as an example to support his point that successful farming can be achieved with minimal machinery.</data>
      <data key="d8">low-impact farming,supporting example</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a8955ba3c4625c18d5ced8e174a4072e</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740880</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Author" target="My Farm">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author owns and operates this 80-acre farm, which serves as the physical location and practical proof of his farming philosophies.</data>
      <data key="d8">farm ownership,practical application</data>
