    <edge source="The Author" target="Missouri">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Author uses the historical treatment of timber ground in Missouri as a negative example of farm management, contrasting it with a more sustainable approach.&lt;SEP&gt;The author's farm, where the described rotation and livestock management practices occur, is located in Missouri, which grounds the examples in a specific geographical context.</data>
      <data key="d8">farm location,geographical context,historical example,land management,regional practice</data>
