    </edge>
    <edge source="The Author" target="The Author's Creek-Bottom Farm">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The author purchased this farm and used its specific conditions (leftover treetops) as a financial resource to help make the property payment.</data>
      <data key="d8">property acquisition,resourcefulness</data>
