    <edge source="Farmer" target="U.s. Internal Revenue Service">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The U.S. Internal Revenue Service establishes a strict definition of a 'farmer' for tax purposes, requiring that two-thirds of gross income comes from farming and that the operation is profitable.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal definition,tax regulation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8b73ca7de046e79c23f93a20f80755db</data>
