    <edge source="Farmer" target="U.s. Bureau Of The Census">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The U.S. Bureau of the Census is related to the 'farmer' category because it attempted to change the official definition by raising the income threshold.</data>
      <data key="d8">definition change,regulatory proposal</data>
