    <edge source="Farmer" target="Webster's New World Dictionary">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Webster's New World Dictionary provides a non-numerical, qualitative definition of a 'farmer', which is contrasted with the quantitative definitions used by government agencies.</data>
