      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The concept of Sustainable Farming is crucial for the long-term success of the Farming Life. By being profitable and self-replenishing, it enables the family to continue their chosen lifestyle on the farm indefinitely.</data>
      <data key="d8">long-term viability,operational philosophy</data>
