      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Midwest" target="Virginia">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Prior to Oren Molovinsky's initiative, farmers in Virginia were shipping their live animals to the Midwest for processing, highlighting a disconnected and inefficient supply chain.</data>
