    <edge source="Midwest" target="Marin Organic">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Marin Organic's gleaning program serves as an influential blueprint for similar projects being established in the Midwest.&lt;SEP&gt;The gleaning program created by Marin Organic has served as an influential model for similar projects established in farming communities in the Midwest.</data>
