      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Draft animals are presented as a viable tool within the broad definition of sustainable agriculture, offering an economical and environmentally sound power source for small farms.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of draft animals is framed within the text as a viable and practical tool for achieving sustainable agriculture, particularly on small-scale farms.</data>
