    <edge source="Sustainable Agriculture" target="Cover Crops">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Cover crops are a key practice used in sustainable agriculture to improve soil health and prevent erosion, as indicated by its inclusion in the index.&lt;SEP&gt;The use of cover crops is provided as a key example of an important principle within sustainable agriculture to conserve soil and improve fertility.</data>
