    <edge source="Sustainable Agriculture" target="Crop Rotation">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Crop rotation is described as a key management tool and a practical application of the diversification principles central to sustainable agriculture.&lt;SEP&gt;The index lists crop rotation as a key management tool and practice, which is a fundamental component of sustainable agriculture.</data>
