    <edge source="Farmers" target="ASAP">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">ASAP implements a marketing strategy that involves creating and distributing colorful posters telling the stories of individual farms and farmers to personalize their products at sales outlets.&lt;SEP&gt;ASAP provides farmers with access to new markets and increased sales opportunities through its 'Appalachian Grown' certification program and marketing support.</data>
