    <edge source="Farmers" target="Appalachian Grown">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Farmers can have their farms certified as 'Appalachian Grown', which allows them to use the brand to market their products and gain consumer trust. 432 farms were certified by 2010.</data>
