    <edge source="Farmers" target="Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD)">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A key nonprofit function of Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD) is to educate, train, and support farmers, including guiding them through certification programs.&lt;SEP&gt;ASD's core mission involves supporting local farmers by recruiting them, helping them transition to organic methods, offering mentoring, and securing markets for their produce.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural support,community development,farmer education,farmer support,recruitment,training</data>
