    <edge source="Farmers" target="Molovinsky">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Molovinsky invested significant personal time building relationships with farmers, which involved long conversations and sharing meals, highlighting the time-consuming but essential nature of creating a local food network.&lt;SEP&gt;Molovinsky works to create pathways for farmers by connecting them with restaurants and helping them understand the business practices of the food-service industry, such as payment terms.</data>
      <data key="d8">advocacy,business education,networking,relationship building,sourcing</data>
