    <edge source="Crops" target="Location/Access">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text states that different areas of the country are noted for different crops due to factors inherent to the location, such as topography, soil, and climate.</data>
      <data key="d8">crop suitability,environmental determinism,regional agriculture</data>
