    <edge source="Crops" target="Enterprise Selection">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Selecting a farm enterprise involves deciding which specific crops to grow, considering factors like soil suitability, water needs, and market demand.</data>
      <data key="d8">enterprise choice,product selection</data>
