    </edge>
    <edge source="Crops" target="Crop Protection Insurance">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Crop protection insurance is a risk management tool for crop enterprises, though the text notes it's harder to get for alternative crops.</data>
      <data key="d8">insurance,risk management</data>
