    </edge>
    <edge source="Crops" target="Season Extenders">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Season extenders like greenhouses are presented as a tool to directly influence crop production by enabling early and late harvests, thereby extending the farm's income period.</data>
