    </edge>
    <edge source="Crop Rotation" target="Livestock Management">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text explains that crops grown in a rotation, such as legumes and sod, can be integrated into livestock management as a source for grazing and hay.</data>
