    </edge>
    <edge source="Low Inputs" target="Soil">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The principle of using low inputs is directly linked to improving the soil and making the farm operation more sustainable.</data>
      <data key="d8">soil health,sustainability</data>
