    <edge source="Soil" target="Plant Roots">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Plant roots have a deep, symbiotic relationship with soil. They draw nutrients and water from the soil to feed the plant, while also feeding soil microorganisms with their dead tissue and providing physical structure to prevent erosion.</data>
