    </edge>
    <edge source="Soil" target="Mycorrhiza">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mycorrhizal associations are an important part of a healthy soil ecosystem, as they enhance plants' ability to absorb nutrients and water from the soil.</data>
