    <edge source="Soil Fertility" target="Management-Intensive Grazing">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text positions management-intensive grazing as a superior management practice and states that such practices allow a farm to maintain or increase its soil fertility.</data>
