    <edge source="Composting" target="Growing Power">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Composting is a core, foundational activity for Growing Power. The organization processes massive amounts of organic waste into compost, which is used for both soil fertility and as a primary heating system for its greenhouses.&lt;SEP&gt;Composting is a foundational practice at Growing Power, used to create the 'good soil' that Will Allen considers essential for all other food production activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Composting is a key activity of Growing Power, as shown by dedicated information on its website and its mention in an article about merging composting and local food at an urban garden.</data>
      <data key="d8">core practice,core process,operational activity,resource management,soil health,sustainable method,sustainable practice,sustainable technology,waste recycling</data>
