      <data key="d11">1753740867</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Nitrogen" target="Green Manure">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Green manure crops, especially legumes, are tilled into the soil to furnish enough nitrogen for the following crop, thereby reducing fertilizer costs.</data>
