    <edge source="Rye" target="Hairy Vetch">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Rye and Hairy Vetch are planted together as a complementary cover crop mix. Rye suppresses weeds and provides biomass, while the legume Hairy Vetch fixes nitrogen.&lt;SEP&gt;Rye and Hairy Vetch are planted together as a winter green-manure cover crop.</data>
