    <edge source="Green Manure" target="Cover Crops">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Cover crops become green manure when they are plowed or disked under, releasing their stored nutrients into the soil.&lt;SEP&gt;Green manure is a specific use of a cover crop, where the crop is incorporated directly into the soil to improve its organic matter and nitrogen content.</data>
