    </edge>
    <edge source="Weeds" target="Multiple-Species Grazing">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Multiple-species grazing is presented as a cost-effective and natural management tool for controlling weeds, serving as an alternative to mowing.</data>
      <data key="d8">natural solution,pest management</data>
