    <edge source="Jim Gerrish" target="Allan Nation">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jim Gerrish and Allan Nation collaborated to change the term 'intensive grazing' to 'management-intensive grazing' (Mig), highlighting a shared philosophy on farm management.&lt;SEP&gt;Jim Gerrish and Allan Nation collaborated to coin the term 'management-intensive grazing' (Mig), shifting the focus from intensity to management.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural philosophy,collaboration,terminology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-551c4a3f4f76cd87581e1acc8d4a5d71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a17c911f4ce144036087ad77f694974d</data>
