      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Gateway Greening is an organization that is based in and serves the community of St. Louis by supporting gardens and an urban farm.&lt;SEP&gt;Gateway Greening's mission is centered on improving the city of St. Louis through greening initiatives, neighborhood stabilization, and community health programs.</data>
