      <data key="d7">Barker gave an interview to Biography Magazine in 2003, outlining his philosophy and plans for promoting home gardening.&lt;SEP&gt;Barker was interviewed by Biography Magazine in 2003, where he outlined his grassroots philosophy and plan for a hypothetical $5 million donation.</data>
