    <edge source="Growing Gardens" target="Portland">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Growing Gardens is a community-focused, nonprofit organization based in and operating within the city of Portland. The organization runs both community and school-based programs, with its school programs specifically targeting certain elementary schools. Growing Gardens also continues the work of Barker's original Home Gardening Project in the city.</data>
      <data key="d8">community engagement,community presence,community service,legacy project,location of operation,operational area,operational base,organization location</data>
