    <edge source="Food Security" target="Beardsley Community Farm">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The entire mission of the Beardsley Community Farm is to promote food security for low-income communities in Knoxville.&lt;SEP&gt;The mission of Beardsley Community Farm is to promote food security in Knoxville's low-income communities.</data>
