    <edge source="Community Garden" target="P-Patch Program">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The P-Patch Program has a specific policy requiring a group of leaders to start a community garden, directly influencing how gardens are formed in Seattle.</data>
      <data key="d8">governance,project initiation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-174591c0f94ab01a05c96941979500a4</data>
