    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Top-down Approach">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text consistently presents the top-down approach as a direct cause of failure for community gardens, contrasting it with the successful 'from the ground up' method.</data>
      <data key="d8">causality,success vs failure</data>
