    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Nuestras Raíces">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Nuestras Raíces is presented as a key case study where a community garden project yielded significant positive outcomes, including empowerment and a farmer incubator.</data>
