    </edge>
    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Michelle Hanna">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Michelle Hanna is a leader in the garden who articulates its key benefits: fostering commitment, developing concrete job skills ('people skills,' project management), and improving her son's diet. Her experience exemplifies the garden's role in personal and professional development.</data>
      <data key="d8">health benefits,personal growth,skill development</data>
