    </edge>
    <edge source="Community Garden" target="The Housing Authority">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Housing Authority initiated the community garden project and later entrusted its successful members with managing a corner store, providing the building and utilities. This shows the garden's success in building resident capacity and earning institutional trust.</data>
      <data key="d8">empowerment,institutional support,project expansion</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Social Capital">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text explicitly states that the garden generates social capital, which is defined as the networks, trust, and goodwill that connect diverse residents who otherwise would not know each other.</data>
      <data key="d8">benefit generation,community building</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Job Skills">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text states that commitment to the garden has given participants specific, resume-enhancing job skills, such as project management and interpersonal skills.</data>
      <data key="d8">economic empowerment,skill development</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Community Garden" target="Health Benefits">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text documents numerous health benefits resulting from garden involvement, such as improved diets, weight loss, lower blood pressure, and increased physical activity, as reported by participants and observed by staff.</data>
      <data key="d8">health outcomes,wellness impact</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-16d7d0c8754f5ccddfb78068c25f0fa0</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
