    <edge source="Backyard Chickens" target="Dave Cieslewicz">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">As Madison's mayor, Dave Cieslewicz is a strong public advocate for backyard chickens, writing blogs that champion their community, economic, and social justice benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Dave Cieslewicz wrote a blog post titled 'A Game of Chicken', discussing the topic of backyard chickens in his city.</data>
