    <edge source="Traditional Agriculture" target="Jonathan Yazzie">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jonathan Yazzie is a direct link to traditional agriculture; his family farm practiced it for generations, and he is now working to help his community reclaim this heritage after its decline due to water loss.</data>
      <data key="d8">heritage practice,restoration effort</data>
