    <edge source="Will Allen" target="Growing Power">
      <data key="d6">64.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Will Allen is the founder, CEO, and charismatic leader of Growing Power, an urban farm initiative he started in 1995. As the primary spokesperson and source of information for the organization, he drives its mission and innovative projects. Growing Power, which is considered the embodiment of Allen's vision and methods, is an advocate for urban agriculture and promotes systems such as aquaponics.</data>
      <data key="d8">advocacy,founder,founding,innovation,leadership,organization,organizational affiliation,organizational development,professional association,spokesperson</data>
