    <edge source="Growing Power" target="Milwaukee">
      <data key="d6">46.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Based in Milwaukee, Growing Power is a major and influential urban farming organization. Its primary operations are physically located in a neighborhood on Milwaukee's North Side, where it runs numerous farms and programs, including its main farm, a retail store, and innovative greenhouses. This main site is notably located on the last remaining farm within the city. Growing Power engages directly with the local community and the city to demonstrate the benefits of urban farming, and its economic success has encouraged the city of Milwaukee to become a partner, helping to brand the city as an urban agriculture hub.</data>
      <data key="d8">community engagement,economic impact,headquarters,local impact,location,operational base,operations,operations base,public-private partnership,urban agriculture,urban development</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1a1f62a42d98fb088984d8c0a7a0d293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0adcf3a18e5a064a6ed2b9d46dff75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48fbe13ccbab1daf20dc4c993f911dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8965f3e3965322fdf5c53aebddde1e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf60421969007759eb279ddb028ec67b</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
