      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Growing Power operates a CSA Market-basket program as one of its core activities to distribute food to various local entities.</data>
      <data key="d8">food distribution,program operation,service delivery</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-cf60421969007759eb279ddb028ec67b</data>
