    <edge source="Growing Power" target="Vertical Farming">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Growing Power has evolved its aquaponics into vertically integrated systems, a form of vertical farming that it teaches to workshop participants.&lt;SEP&gt;Growing Power uses vertical farming as a key strategy to achieve high yields and profitability on a small urban footprint.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural method,business model,innovation,methodology,system integration</data>
