      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Growing Power develops, utilizes, and teaches others how to build advanced, vertically integrated aquaponics systems as a key component of its high-efficiency urban farming model.&lt;SEP&gt;Growing Power has developed and uses a low-cost, high-yield, vertically integrated aquaponics system to produce both fish and vegetables.</data>
      <data key="d8">education,innovation,operational system,technology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-1a1f62a42d98fb088984d8c0a7a0d293&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48fbe13ccbab1daf20dc4c993f911dd2</data>
