    <edge source="Elk" target="Fallow Deer">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both entities represent farming operations for cervids (deer family). They are related by the type of animal but contrast in the scale of the financial model presented (a 27-animal herd for elk vs. a per-doe basis for deer) and the primary income sources listed (breeding stock/velvet vs. venison/hides). The Elk operation shows significantly higher profit with very low labor.</data>
