    <edge source="Local Food System" target="Appalachian Sustainable Development">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Appalachian Sustainable Development is described as being 'tremendously effective' in building a local food system through its work as a distributor for small-scale farmers.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary mission of Appalachian Sustainable Development is to build and facilitate a robust local food system by developing markets, providing distribution, and training farmers.</data>
      <data key="d8">food systems,mission objective,non-profit impact,system building</data>
