    <edge source="Local Food System" target="Appalachian Sustainable Agriculture Project (ASAP)">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">ASAP's primary mission is to effect long-term change in the infrastructure of the local food system by creating markets and demand where they previously did not exist.&lt;SEP&gt;ASAP's work is centered on understanding and strengthening the Local Food System by connecting its various components, such as farms, distributors, and institutions.</data>
      <data key="d8">infrastructure development,market creation,network building,system change,system development</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9fee18f76430d121ab613984069f209e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5944a88ca415780f3d4838a47d068512</data>
