      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Charlie Jackson explains the complexity and interconnectedness of the Local Food System, using a paraphrase of John Muir to illustrate his point, and leads ASAP's efforts within it.&lt;SEP&gt;Charlie Jackson, through his work with ASAP, is a primary agent of change focused on researching, building, and strengthening the local food system in his region.</data>
      <data key="d8">community organizing,leadership,system analysis,system building</data>
