      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">ASD's primary goal is the creation and growth of a local food system, which it achieves through farmer education, networking, and brokering distribution.&lt;SEP&gt;The core mission of Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD) is to facilitate the development and reestablishment of a robust local food system in its region.</data>
