      <data key="d7">Widmark champions the concept of the local food system as a way to value and preserve rural lands for their role in feeding communities.&lt;SEP&gt;Widmark is a key proponent of the local food system, working to solve its challenges (like affordability and infrastructure) and articulating a vision for its future success.</data>
