    <edge source="Community GroundWorks" target="Troy Gardens">
      <data key="d6">39.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Community GroundWorks is the nonprofit parent organization responsible for the Troy Gardens program. As the primary managing organization, it manages, stewards, and operates the entire Troy Gardens project, which is situated on 26 acres of greenspace, and runs all of the site's programs, including its community gardens.</data>
      <data key="d8">community leadership,management,operation,organizational structure,program management,project management,stewardship</data>
