    <edge source="Troy Gardens" target="Affordable Housing">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A primary goal of the Troy Gardens project was to provide affordable housing, with 20 of its 30 units being permanently designated as such.&lt;SEP&gt;Affordable housing is one of the five designated functions of the Troy Gardens site. A 5-acre portion of the land is dedicated to it, featuring 30 cohousing units.</data>
      <data key="d8">land use,mission integration,site feature,social benefit,social mission</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-463bc71b9c03d72246d0c3904090b54a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6524af1074c6309e3cd8d13cbf621c2b</data>
