    <edge source="Small Family Farms" target="Permaculture">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">While not a direct relationship, permaculture represents a potential modern pathway for smaller-scale, diversified farming that aligns with the ethos of traditional small family farms, contrasting with the large-scale industrial model.</data>
