    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD)">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">ASD and Lynchburg Grows have a mutually beneficial partnership, where ASD supplies produce to the Lynchburg Grows CSA, which is located along ASD's delivery route.&lt;SEP&gt;Lynchburg Grows formed a mutually beneficial partnership with ASD, where ASD supplies produce to help Lynchburg Grows fill its weekly CSA baskets.&lt;SEP&gt;Lynchburg Grows formed a partnership with Appalachian Sustainable Development (ASD) to purchase produce at wholesale, ensuring their CSA program has a reliable and diverse supply of food for its shareholders.</data>
      <data key="d8">cooperation,mutual benefit,partnership,supply chain</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-497b3487d00eabefe426a10fa32f8010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f4b1f56482ca88dc86d76611131fea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ebf31ca8cf0e8a5dbe6d09c3efa272</data>
