    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Michael Van Ness">
      <data key="d6">58.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Michael Van Ness is a co-founder and the Executive Director of Lynchburg Grows. As a key leader, he was the one who first discovered the site for the organization and envisioned its potential. Van Ness defines Lynchburg Grows' core mission, which focuses on community contribution and teaching empathy, and he guides its overall philosophy and operations. He is noted for articulating the organization's successful and patient philosophy. In his capacity as a representative for Lynchburg Grows, he also provides expert advice on the topic of volunteer liability.</data>
      <data key="d8">founding,leadership,organizational management,organizational mission,organizational strategy,personnel,representation,risk management,vision</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cee86d7056c73fbe7bdaa432b2abe64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61443c6300dbc7b6e2bd6de269518650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4daf18984831b8673c2be0060612bd34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174591c0f94ab01a05c96941979500a4</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
