    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Dereck Cunningham">
      <data key="d6">39.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Dereck Cunningham is the co-founder, President, and a representative of Lynchburg Grows. His personal life story of finding purpose through gardening despite a disability served as a foundational inspiration for the farm's mission. In his leadership role, Cunningham provides guidance on how to successfully integrate individuals with diverse needs into the farm's activities, ensuring his personal experiences align deeply with the organization's work.</data>
      <data key="d8">founding,inspiration,leadership,mission,operational guidance,personnel,representation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61443c6300dbc7b6e2bd6de269518650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9189adec7b34964ca2342aea2d2b666e</data>
