      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Scott Lowman">
      <data key="d6">29.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Scott Lowman is a co-founder and leader of Lynchburg Grows, working with the other founders to establish the urban farm.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Lowman is a co-founder and the Director of Stewardship for Lynchburg Grows, articulating the organization's operational philosophy for working with its participants.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Lowman is listed as a representative for Lynchburg Grows.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,founding,leadership,operational philosophy,personnel,representation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-81005569d65546868c017fed474ad248&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61443c6300dbc7b6e2bd6de269518650</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Lynchburg">
      <data key="d6">56.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows is an urban farm and organization located and operating within the city of Lynchburg. It serves the local residents and community through a variety of food and social programs, which are facilitated by various partnerships. As part of its operations, Lynchburg Grows converts vacant city lots into gardens. The city of Lynchburg is the host city for the farm and maintains a mutually beneficial partnership with Lynchburg Grows, which includes an arrangement for composting materials. Additionally, the city government provided the initial data on the site's contamination.</data>
      <data key="d8">civic partnership,community,community focus,community presence,community service,local impact,location,urban agriculture,urban renewal</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9189adec7b34964ca2342aea2d2b666e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cee86d7056c73fbe7bdaa432b2abe64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61443c6300dbc7b6e2bd6de269518650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d076831b7a91bcd605c1e387112d81e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ebf31ca8cf0e8a5dbe6d09c3efa272</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Lynchburg Daily Bread">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows supports Lynchburg Daily Bread by providing weekly donations of fresh produce for its meal service.</data>
      <data key="d8">community support,food donation,partnership</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="People With Special Needs And Disabilities">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The core mission of Lynchburg Grows is to empower and provide opportunities for people with special needs and disabilities.</data>
      <data key="d8">empowerment,mission focus,social enterprise</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
