      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows operates a CSA program, delivering 120 shares to members and providing scholarship shares, as a primary method for distributing its food.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,community agriculture,food distribution</data>
