    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Educational Outreach">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Educational Outreach is a core activity for Lynchburg Grows, as it seeks to empower the broader community by teaching food-growing skills.</data>
      <data key="d8">community empowerment,education,mission activity</data>
