    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Historic Greenhouses">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows is located within and has restored the historic greenhouses, making them the centerpiece of its urban farm operation.&lt;SEP&gt;The historic greenhouses are Lynchburg Grows' 'greatest asset,' and the organization's efforts are focused on restoring all nine of them for productive uses as part of its multifaceted mission.</data>
      <data key="d8">asset management,historic preservation,operational base,restoration,site restoration</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5b97e15a0b1c4d19efdaa6af5f597519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0ebf31ca8cf0e8a5dbe6d09c3efa272</data>
