    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Schenkel Family">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows was established on property purchased from the Schenkel Family, who supported the new use of the land as it honored their family's history with the greenhouses.</data>
      <data key="d8">community support,land acquisition,property history</data>
