    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Farmer for a Day">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">'Farmer for a Day' is an educational program created and operated by Lynchburg Grows as part of its community outreach and youth education mission.&lt;SEP&gt;Lynchburg Grows created and operates the 'Farmer for a Day' program to provide weekly work experience and skill-building opportunities for young people.</data>
      <data key="d8">community outreach,education,program hosting,program management,youth development</data>
