    <edge source="Lynchburg Grows" target="Brownfields Remediation Program">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Lynchburg Grows successfully entered the Brownfields Remediation Program to get the financial and technical help needed to clean up its contaminated site and receive liability protection.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental cleanup,funding,program participation</data>
