      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Tera Wick founded the garden projects for Janus Youth and is credited with establishing the foundational, humble approach that defines the organization's success in this area.&lt;SEP&gt;Tera Wick is a key supervising staff person at Janus Youth who was instrumental in creating one of its major programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Tera Wick was a key innovator at Janus Youth who established the organization's community-led philosophy and was instrumental in expanding its garden programs.</data>
