    <edge source="Janus Youth" target="Dennis Morrow">
      <data key="d6">37.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Dennis Morrow serves as the executive director of Janus Youth, where he provides leadership and acts as a spokesperson for the organization. In his role, he articulates the history, core philosophy, and transformative successes of Janus Youth's programs. This philosophy is centered on respect, community empowerment, and community relationships. Under Morrow's leadership, the organization has also expanded its role into community food projects.</data>
      <data key="d8">leadership,organizational growth,organizational philosophy,social services,spokesperson</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-959e33ece6a9fc720452b33659ca7996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f8b5f47647da9706f2d5877b878fae0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45291ea55455adae718c5031c0e8dfff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c331074eb4b375b2a5a5a014411e2c8</data>
