    </edge>
    <edge source="Janus Youth" target="St. Johns Woods">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Through the efforts of Tera Wick and community partners, Janus Youth initiated, facilitated, and implemented a community-led garden program in the St. Johns Woods public housing community. The program was a success, leading to significant positive social outcomes, including a dramatic decrease in police calls, an increase in community responsibility, and the formation of a strong partnership.</data>
      <data key="d8">community intervention,community outreach,community partnership,program implementation,program site,social impact,social intervention</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-45291ea55455adae718c5031c0e8dfff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05be2e4c27c7eabe9de8d2ff56b840a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c331074eb4b375b2a5a5a014411e2c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edff28cc5d3b6f311f02cd2481c28fb7</data>
