    <edge source="Janus Youth" target="Food Works">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Food Works is a teen farm and gardening program for at-risk youths that was initiated, developed, and is operated by Janus Youth. As a core part of its mission to empower communities, Janus Youth facilitates and supports the Food Works program, which was a direct and remarkable outcome of its successful community gardening initiatives. The program aims to address food insecurity and provide teen empowerment and is cited as an example of successful, community-driven project evolution.</data>
