    <edge source="Nuestras Raíces" target="Holyoke, Massachusetts">
      <data key="d6">67.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Nuestras Raíces is a community organization that was founded by community members in Holyoke, Massachusetts. It is based in, operates within, and serves the community of Holyoke, where it has grown into a major project that is deeply integrated with the city. The organization focuses on improving the lives of residents through community development, food, and environmental projects, using gardening as a foundation for broader community empowerment programs and transforming local abandoned lots.</data>
