      <data key="d7">Nuestras Raíces served immigrant farmers from Puerto Rico by establishing the La Finquita garden to meet their needs.&lt;SEP&gt;Nuestras Raíces was founded by Puerto Rican immigrants and a central part of its mission is to reclaim and celebrate the community's Puerto Rican rural heritage and culture.</data>
      <data key="d8">community service,cultural heritage,demographic focus,founding principle</data>
