    <edge source="Mary Seton Corboy" target="Greensgrow Farm">
      <data key="d6">55.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mary Seton Corboy is the co-founder, leader, and a central figure at Greensgrow Farm, an organization she runs and for which she is cited as an expert. A key to Greensgrow Farm's success is Corboy's philosophy of avoiding overcapitalization, and the farm itself serves as a real-world example of her principles in action. As a leader in the farm's story of innovation and adaptation, Corboy reports on its business strategies and successes, such as its nursery business, and shares the experiences and lessons learned from operating it.</data>
      <data key="d8">business philosophy,expertise,farm management,founder,leadership,organizational affiliation,organizational leadership,reporting,spokesperson</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-bcbabc72a18ceaedb14452609db7d256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f4b1f56482ca88dc86d76611131fea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-951f3a20705ad68da0aafd6377f51f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0d4e7d44014acab56e26cbaa12a896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd762b4d6c9647db05924d3e745a6991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd12c93ca420ae0dfd8107f51eec1886</data>
