      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">SELROSLT is the community-based land trust formed by residents of South End/Lower Roxbury to preserve their neighborhood gardens.&lt;SEP&gt;SELROSLT is the land trust that governs and manages the community gardens within the South End/Lower Roxbury area.</data>
