    <edge source="SELROSLT" target="Urban Renewal">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The formation of SELROSLT was a direct community response to the long-term effects of urban renewal and the subsequent development pressures that threatened the gardens created in its wake.</data>
      <data key="d8">community reaction,founding motivation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-c0b1f6adc63dbe7f3160ab5bd7b25233</data>
