      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SELROSLT" target="The City of Boston">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The City of Boston's 1986 redevelopment plan, which involved bulldozing a community garden, was the direct catalyst for the community organizing that led to the formation of SELROSLT to protect the remaining gardens.</data>
      <data key="d8">catalyst for formation,conflict</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-c0b1f6adc63dbe7f3160ab5bd7b25233</data>
