    <edge source="Chickens, Broilers" target="Fallow Deer">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">This relationship compares the enterprises with the highest and lowest labor requirements. Broiler Chickens are the most labor-intensive at 500 hours, whereas the Fallow Deer model is the least, at only 3 hours. This illustrates the vast difference in time commitment required across different farming types.</data>
      <data key="d8">Labor Intensity,Operational Efficiency,Time Management</data>
