    </edge>
    <edge source="Sheep, Feeder Lamb" target="Sheep, Milk">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">This pair contrasts two distinct sheep business models: a high-labor, high-investment, high-profit dairy operation ($143.44 profit, 15 hours) versus a very low-labor, low-profit fattening operation ($14.02 profit, 1 hour).</data>
      <data key="d8">business model comparison,labor-profit tradeoff</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a6d072f41d662cb326c1c528ac3c5c51</data>
