    </edge>
    <edge source="Sheep, Feeder Lamb" target="Sheep (10-Week Lamb)">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">This relationship highlights the extreme difference in labor requirements between two types of sheep meat enterprises. The '10-Week Lamb' operation requires 200 hours, while the 'Feeder Lamb' model requires only 1 hour, illustrating a contrast between a large-scale operation and a minimal-input side business.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,labor intensity,scale of operation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a6d072f41d662cb326c1c528ac3c5c51</data>
