    <edge source="Gladheart Farms" target="Michael Porterfield">
      <data key="d6">69.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Michael Porterfield is the owner, founder, and operator of Gladheart Farms. Having acquired the land and established the entire operation himself, he now develops its business strategies, such as the corporate CSA model, and his farming philosophy is demonstrated through the farm's success. As the owner, he also provides insights on managing volunteers and interns. In addition to his operational duties, Michael Porterfield serves as a representative for Gladheart Farms, advocating for the creation of business plans for urban farms.</data>
      <data key="d8">business advocacy,business operation,farming,founder,leadership,management,ownership,personnel,representation</data>
