    <edge source="Edwin Marty" target="Jones Valley Urban Farm">
      <data key="d6">59.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Based on the information provided, Edwin Marty is the co-founder and executive director of Jones Valley Urban Farm, where he also serves as a representative. Drawing from his leadership role, he shares lessons learned from the farm's operational challenges and uses the organization as an example to discuss topics such as staff compensation and retention. Furthermore, Edwin Marty advocates for the Community Supported Agriculture (CSA) model based on his experience at Jones Valley Urban Farm.</data>
      <data key="d8">advocacy,founder,leadership,management,organization management,organizational learning,organizational management,personnel,representation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8c46a7f814f9b988da76a9ac71bdab30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f188db350c6a6f2fdb22a9e9283e4dc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcbabc72a18ceaedb14452609db7d256&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0adcf3a18e5a064a6ed2b9d46dff75f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad0d4e7d44014acab56e26cbaa12a896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9297eb734555e7b850045590e4fc5cb6</data>
