      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Along with her husband Jamie, Amy Ager is described as part of the 'grass farmers' generation, sharing the same sustainable agricultural principles.</data>
      <data key="d8">professional identity,shared philosophy</data>
