      <data key="d6">40.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jamie Ager is the primary operator, co-owner, and steward of Hickory Nut Gap Farm, which is his family's land that he leases from them. Also listed as a representative for the farm, Ager's entire farming philosophy and business are centered on its activities. He is managing the farm's transformation into a sustainable business and uses its success to illustrate the viability of an alternative to the industrial agricultural system.</data>
