    <edge source="Mary Corboy" target="Diversification">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mary Corboy is the chief proponent of diversification as a business strategy for Greensgrow, implementing multiple income streams like the nursery and expanded farmers' market.</data>
