    <edge source="Mary Corboy" target="Greensgrow Csa">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mary Corboy designed the Greensgrow CSA's unique model to provide a diverse 'picnic basket' of goods from various local producers, specifically to appeal to urban consumers.</data>
