    <edge source="Joel Salatin" target="Polyface Farm">
      <data key="d6">90.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Based on the information provided, Joel Salatin is the founder, owner, and operator of Polyface Farm, serving as its visionary leader, innovator, guiding voice, and representative. His identity is deeply intertwined with the farm, which functions as the practical implementation of his unique philosophies. At Polyface Farm, Salatin develops and articulates core principles related to sustainable agriculture, community, and "ethics-based anti-Wall Street" business practices. The farm is recognized as an influential and successful model of sustainable agriculture that has served as an inspiration for others, such as Jamie Ager.</data>
      <data key="d8">affiliation,agricultural innovation,agricultural model,business philosophy,farm management,farm operation,farm ownership,farming leadership,founder,innovation,inspirational model,leadership,operations,ownership,personnel,representation,sustainable agriculture</data>
