      <data key="d7">Joel Salatin harnesses the natural instinct of pigs to turn the farm's compost, an example of his philosophy of using animal behavior to the farm's benefit.&lt;SEP&gt;Joel Salatin innovated the use of pigs at Polyface, harnessing their natural rooting behavior to turn compost and developing the acorn finishing system that transformed the farm's economics.</data>
