    <edge source="Joel Salatin" target="Polyface">
      <data key="d6">40.0</data>
      <data key="d7">As the owner, visionary leader, and innovator of Polyface farm, Joel Salatin is the guiding force who established its core mission and philosophy, which is centered on healing the land. He is also responsible for developing the farm's innovative agricultural systems, business models, and expansion strategies. These strategies include the creation of partnership models designed to grow the business and support new farmers.</data>
      <data key="d8">business strategy,farm management,farm philosophy,innovation,leadership,ownership,vision</data>
