      <data key="d7">Based on the information provided, Joel Salatin and Sheri Salatin are representatives for Polyface Farm, where they share a close professional and family relationship, likely as spouses and partners. They collaborate to run the farm, managing a family-integrated life and work. An example of their partnership is the farm's Buying Club; Joel initiated it by setting the first order threshold, after which Sheri took over its management and successfully grew it into a major part of the business.</data>
      <data key="d8">business development,colleagues,family relationship,farm management,farm partnership,partnership</data>
