    <edge source="Joel Salatin" target="Kahn">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Salatin and Kahn represent the two opposing poles in the debate over the future of the organic food movement. Salatin champions the local, ethics-based model, while Kahn defends the mainstream, industrial-scale approach.</data>
