    <edge source="Joel Salatin" target="Walmart">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Salatin uses Walmart as an example of the industrial food system he opposes, particularly in how regulations and processing costs create a price structure that favors large suppliers over small, local producers like himself.</data>
