    <edge source="Joel Salatin" target="Regulation">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Joel Salatin explicitly identifies regulation as a primary factor creating an unfair economic landscape. He argues that the regulatory costs are scaled for large industries, which puts small-scale, local farms like his at a significant financial disadvantage.</data>
