      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">FoodCorps specifically focuses its efforts on Farm to School programs, which is the exact mission of the National Farm to School Network.&lt;SEP&gt;The organizations are closely linked through leadership, as a cofounder of FoodCorps is also a staff member of the National Farm to School Network (NFSN).</data>
