    <edge source="Jonathan Yazzie" target="Jonathan Yazzie's Father">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jonathan Yazzie's father represents the success of the family's past farming traditions, providing a stark contrast to the farm's current inactive state and motivating Yazzie's restoration efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Jonathan is the son of a Navajo medicine man and honored his father's memory by following the tradition of resting the fields after his death.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural tradition,familial heritage,family legacy,historical benchmark,succession</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-fa7136637ee2d131a4ae76b9cf2f5717&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51fe95d161b4f1f67e45381ccbc2d83e</data>
