    </edge>
    <edge source="Jonathan Yazzie" target="Water Scarcity">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jonathan Yazzie's life and work are defined by the impacts of water scarcity, which shut down his family's multigenerational farm and now fuels his activism to reclaim water rights for his community.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental impact,personal motivation</data>
