      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Jonathan Yazzie is dedicated to reviving traditional Navajo farming within his community by addressing water rights, re-establishing farm committees, and mentoring other families.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural revival,community leadership,cultural preservation</data>
