      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Rose Marie Williams has a direct economic and community connection to Tuba City, Arizona, where her farm stand is located and routinely sells out, demonstrating the local demand for her traditional produce.&lt;SEP&gt;Rose Marie Williams lives, farms, and is an active community leader in Tuba City, Arizona, working to restore local agricultural practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Tuba City, Arizona is the home and place of work for Rose Marie Williams, a Navajo farmer and rancher.</data>
