    <edge source="Carl Honeyestewa" target="Traditional Hopi Farming">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Carl is a dedicated practitioner of Traditional Hopi Farming and serves as the main voice in the text expressing concern that this agricultural heritage is a 'precarious asset' that could be lost.</data>
