      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Carl's service as a US Marine in Iraq is a key part of his identity, presented alongside his role as a Hopi farmer, illustrating the complex, dual nature of his identity as a modern American and a keeper of ancient traditions.</data>
      <data key="d8">dual identity,military service,patriotism</data>
