    <edge source="Traditional Farming" target="Mainstream Farming">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text implicitly and explicitly contrasts the spiritual, holistic, and culturally integrated practice of Traditional Farming with the methods of Mainstream Farming.</data>
      <data key="d8">comparative methods,cultural values,philosophical contrast</data>
