    <edge source="Traditional Farming" target="Holy People">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">According to the beliefs described, the act of Traditional Farming is a form of prayer and the primary way to connect with the Holy People, who in turn provide healing and guidance.</data>
