    <edge source="Northern Minnesota" target="White Earth Land Recovery Project">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The White Earth Land Recovery Project is located and operates in northern Minnesota, which is also the habitat of the native wild rice it seeks to protect.</data>
