    <edge source="University of Minnesota" target="Wild Rice (Manoomin)">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The University of Minnesota's development of domesticated wild rice versions is presented as a threat that ironically endangered the native wild rice by outcompeting it in the market.</data>
