    <edge source="LaDuke" target="Wild Rice">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">LaDuke's writing is used to illustrate the significant differences between authentic lake wild rice and paddy rice, emphasizing the cultural and sensory importance of the traditional food.</data>
