    </edge>
    <edge source="Ojibwe" target="Busch Agricultural Resources">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Ojibwe tribe filed the lawsuit 'Wabizii v. Busch Agricultural Resources' against the company for false and misleading advertising of its paddy-grown rice.</data>
      <data key="d8">false advertising,indigenous rights,legal dispute</data>
