    </edge>
    <edge source="Ojibwe" target="Minnesota State Legislature">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Ojibwe tribe successfully sought legal protection from the Minnesota State Legislature, which resulted in a bill being passed in 2007 to protect native wild rice from genetic engineering.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental law,legislative protection,political advocacy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ef9c9aefa244f3e5e6f50b424cd984c4</data>
