    <edge source="Minnesota State Legislature" target="H2410/S2096">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Minnesota State Legislature is the body that passed the bill H2410/S2096 in May 2007, creating a moratorium on the genetic engineering of wild rice.</data>
      <data key="d8">environmental regulation,law creation,legislative action</data>
