      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Minnesota Department of Natural Resources" target="Manoomin (Wild Rice)">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Minnesota Department of Natural Resources produced a formal study on 'Natural Wild Rice in Minnesota,' which is also known as Manoomin.</data>
