      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Genetic Policy Alliance is mentioned as a type of organization that groups like the White Earth Land Recovery Project can contact for assistance with legal and policy strategies.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal assistance,policy advocacy,resource</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-fac6f2d596c9d9fe2bc3b9afda4f10df</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="White Earth Land Recovery Project" target="Lawsuit of 1988">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The White Earth Land Recovery Project initiated the lawsuit in 1988 as a legal strategy to protect native wild rice.</data>
      <data key="d8">advocacy,legal action,protection</data>
