    <edge source="Wild Rice" target="Paddy Rice">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text draws a sharp contrast between native lake-harvested wild rice and machine-harvested paddy rice, highlighting differences in quality, aroma, and cultural significance, and noting the legal conflict over misleading marketing.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural value,legal conflict,product contrast</data>
