    <edge source="Southern Seed Exposure Exchange" target="Seed-saving Bank">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Southern Seed Exposure Exchange is presented as a specific, regional example of a seed-saving effort, which is a form of seed-saving bank.</data>
