    <edge source="Deborah Habib" target="Renewable Energy">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Deborah Habib is a strong advocate for renewable energy, using her farm as a demonstration that living on it does not involve sacrifice and challenging misinformation on the topic.</data>
