    </edge>
    <edge source="Fossil Fuels" target="Seeds Of Solidarity">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The entire operational philosophy of Seeds of Solidarity is centered on reducing reliance on fossil fuels through the use of solar power, no-till farming, and biodiesel.</data>
      <data key="d8">energy independence,fossil fuel reduction,sustainability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-bf0fadd2de5cdd877a432eba713a59ce</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Industrial Food System" target="Diablo Burger">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Diablo Burger's focus on local, sustainable, and affordable food is presented as a direct challenge and a practical alternative to the unsustainable industrial food system.</data>
      <data key="d8">alternative model,ideological contrast</data>
