    <edge source="Seeds Of Solidarity" target="Solar Energy">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Seeds of Solidarity is fundamentally dependent on solar energy, using three separate systems to power its entire operation, including its home, greenhouse irrigation, and the mobile SOL Patrol van.</data>
