      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Seeds of Solidarity owns and operates the SOL Patrol van, which serves as a crucial mobile power source for their farm equipment, embodying their commitment to mobile, renewable energy.</data>
      <data key="d8">asset ownership,mobile power,operational equipment</data>
