    <edge source="Seeds Of Solidarity" target="No-Till Methods">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Seeds of Solidarity practices no-till methods as a core part of its farming strategy to reduce machinery use, decrease fossil fuel consumption, and improve soil health.</data>
