    <edge source="Walking Fish" target="Beaufort, North Carolina">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Walking Fish CSF is located and operates in the city of Beaufort, North Carolina.&lt;SEP&gt;Walking Fish is a community-supported fishery that operates in the coastal community of Beaufort, North Carolina.</data>
      <data key="d8">community base,location,operational base,operational location</data>
