      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Walking Fish" target="Fishtowne">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Fishtowne is the operational hub for Walking Fish, where the co-op's seafood is processed and displayed.&lt;SEP&gt;Fishtowne's owner, Bill Rice, was a key partner in the creation of Walking Fish, looking for a new model to help the fishermen who supplied his market.</data>
      <data key="d8">business partnership,founding,operational center,processing partner,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-bf0fadd2de5cdd877a432eba713a59ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7a0cfcfab5c2708055ae5c22dacee5f</data>
