    </edge>
    <edge source="Chipotle Mexican Grill" target="Steve Ells">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Steve Ells is the founder and CEO of Chipotle Mexican Grill and was the driving force behind initiating the partnership with Polyface, aligning it with his company's 'Food with Integrity' vision.</data>
      <data key="d8">corporate vision,founding,leadership</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chipotle Mexican Grill" target="Buying Club">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Buying Club's purchasing of certain pork cuts (ribs, bacon) complements Chipotle's purchasing of other cuts (shoulder, ham), which was a necessary arrangement for Polyface to be able to supply Chipotle while moving the whole animal.</data>
      <data key="d8">market ecosystem,supply chain solution,symbiotic sales</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
