      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Chipotle's large-volume needs drive the conversation about scaling up, highlighting the pressure on small farms and the company's preference for aggregated supply chains.</data>
      <data key="d8">market demand,scaling driver,supply chain pressure</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-07373ff8a8e2c42149614780aa736a26</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
