    </edge>
    <edge source="Pigs" target="Model A Farmer">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">In her third year, the Model A farmer chose to switch from raising broilers to raising pigs, which she found to be physically easier work.</data>
      <data key="d8">labor,livestock management,operational change</data>
