      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Buying Club">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Polyface Buying Club is a critical sales channel for Polyface farm, accounting for 45% of its total sales and embodying its local-first, direct-to-consumer philosophy.&lt;SEP&gt;The Polyface Buying Club is the distribution arm for Polyface's products. The farm uses it to aggregate products from other growers, which improves the economics of the deliveries.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,community engagement,direct sales,distribution,economies of scale,logistics</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ab7679e841cce082d6f5f864896c9afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Acorn Finishing">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface farm utilizes the acorn finishing system as a core part of its pig-raising operation, which has fundamentally improved its economic model and product quality.</data>
      <data key="d8">farm economics,innovation,sustainable practice</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ab7679e841cce082d6f5f864896c9afe</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Real Farm Experience">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The 'Real Farm Experience' is the official summer internship program hosted by Polyface farm to educate and train the next generation of farmers in sustainable agriculture.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural education,legacy,training program</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ab7679e841cce082d6f5f864896c9afe</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Customers">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface sells its products to its customers, and the presence of these customers for one product (e.g., milk) creates synergistic opportunities to sell them other products (e.g., eggs, sausage).&lt;SEP&gt;Polyface supplies food to its customer base, which includes families, restaurants, and retail outlets. The partnership models are a way to meet this growing demand.&lt;SEP&gt;Polyface's business model is entirely dependent on its relationship with its customers, as it does not advertise and relies on their loyalty and word-of-mouth to drive sales and growth.</data>
      <data key="d8">business philosophy,customer base,customer sales,customer-centric model,direct sales,direct-to-consumer,market demand,supply chain,synergistic marketing</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ab7679e841cce082d6f5f864896c9afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Sheri Salatin">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Sheri Salatin is a key figure at Polyface, providing insight into the farm's immersive apprenticeship program and its integration of new farmers into their family and way of life.</data>
      <data key="d8">apprenticeship program,farm culture,management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Golden Acres Orchard">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface serves as the number-one sales outlet for Golden Acres Orchard's apple juice, demonstrating a mutually beneficial business partnership based on product aggregation and distribution.</data>
      <data key="d8">business partnership,distribution,economies of scale</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Family of Farms">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">'Family of Farms' is the name Polyface gives to its own expansion strategy, which involves partnering with and supporting new farmers, making the concept central to the organization's growth.</data>
      <data key="d8">expansion model,farmer network,partnership</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Bioregional Food Clusters">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface's current practice of aggregating products from other farms to improve the economics of its deliveries is described as a 'microcosm' of the larger-scale system Joel Salatin envisions with his 'Bioregional Food Clusters' model.</data>
      <data key="d8">business strategy,microcosm,proof of concept</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Beyond Organic Food">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface is a producer of 'beyond organic' food, and the rising consumer demand for this specific category is the primary driver behind the farm's need to scale up its business.</data>
      <data key="d8">business driver,market demand,production</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Apprenticeship Program">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface established and runs the year-round apprenticeship program as a way to get dedicated, long-term help while training and supporting new farmers.</data>
      <data key="d8">education,farmer training,labor</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Internship Program">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface offers a seasonal internship program focused on poultry as a way for individuals to experience farming without a long-term commitment.</data>
      <data key="d8">education,farmer training,recruitment</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-74e3df5ce7be88ffd8bdf29e5b896da3</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model A">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface implements Model A by leasing a farm, providing all infrastructure and livestock, and paying a contract farmer based on their production, thereby expanding its operations without the farmer incurring debt.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,contract farming,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model B">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface implements Model B by leasing land and paying a new farmer a lump sum to manage its cattle, while also allowing the farmer to build their own business on the same land in exchange for a small royalty.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,partnership,royalty agreement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Eggmobiles">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Eggmobiles are a key piece of infrastructure owned and deployed by Polyface as part of its farming system, particularly within the 'Model A' partnership for egg and broiler production.&lt;SEP&gt;Eggmobiles are a key piece of portable infrastructure used and financed within the Polyface farming models to help new farmers establish their own egg businesses.</data>
      <data key="d8">agricultural method,business tool,farm infrastructure,farming infrastructure,operational component</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model A Farmer">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface has a contractual relationship with the Model A Farmer, where it provides the farm, infrastructure, and livestock, and she provides the labor in exchange for per-piece payment.</data>
      <data key="d8">contract farming,labor,partnership</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model B Farmer">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Model B Farmer is a former apprentice of Polyface who now has a contractual partnership with the farm to manage its cow herd in exchange for a lump-sum payment.</data>
      <data key="d8">contract farming,mentorship,partnership</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Cow Herd">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface owns the beef cow herd and leases land for it, creating the Model B partnership to ensure the herd is managed daily for improved land health.</data>
      <data key="d8">asset ownership,herd management,sustainable practice</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3699752bc52dee1358ad76a26a9c6fb9</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model C: Own Brand">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface designed and implements 'Model C: Own Brand' as a method to develop new, subcontracted farmers who can build their own businesses while utilizing Polyface's infrastructure and market access.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model creation,entrepreneurship,farm incubation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Model D: Lease to Own">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface created the 'Model D: Lease to Own' program, providing financing and a pathway to ownership for new farmers, which helps Polyface meet increased demand for its products while fostering independent farm businesses.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model creation,equity building,farm financing</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Land Healing">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Land Healing is the central mission and 'whole motivation' of Polyface farm. All of its agricultural practices and business models are designed to be profitable methods for achieving this environmental goal.</data>
      <data key="d8">core philosophy,mission,sustainable agriculture</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Joel Holland">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">As Chipotle's head chef, Joel Holland directly addressed the unique properties of Polyface's pork by developing a new oven-braising cooking method to achieve the best results, demonstrating a hands-on adaptation to the supplier's product.&lt;SEP&gt;Joel Holland, as Chipotle's head chef, collaborated with Polyface to reformulate a key recipe. This was necessary to accommodate the unique qualities of Polyface's pork, demonstrating a deep level of product integration.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,culinary collaboration,culinary development,product adaptation,quality control</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63208f55f5e282db2dc1514f989da622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface Intern/Apprentice">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface serves as a training ground for interns and apprentices, who often become the new farmers that participate in the farm's business expansion models.</data>
      <data key="d8">farmer pipeline,mentorship,training program</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Buying Club">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Buying Club is a customer entity that purchases specific pork cuts from Polyface, enabling the farm to successfully sell the entire animal, which is critical for its partnership with bulk buyers like Chipotle.</data>
      <data key="d8">customer relationship,market segmentation,whole animal sales</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="New Farmer (Model D)">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Polyface provides the farm, rent-free housing, and initial financing for infrastructure to the New Farmer in the Model D program, in exchange for labor and as a way to meet increased demand.</data>
      <data key="d8">financing,incubation,mentorship</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-77562613f0c5d12383f7ffab65ce2e45</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Polyface" target="Heidi Wederquist">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Heidi Wederquist, from Chipotle's purchasing department, solved a critical logistical barrier for the Polyface partnership by devising a way to monitor the meat's temperature during transport using microchip thermometers.</data>
      <data key="d8">logistics,problem-solving,supply chain</data>
