    <edge source="Polyface" target="Polyface's Buying Club">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Buying Club is an alternative and more lucrative sales channel for Polyface's beef, contrasting with the wholesale partnership model offered by Chipotle.</data>
