    <edge source="Polyface" target="Petrilli">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Petrilli, from Chipotle's perspective, describes the practical challenges of working with Polyface, such as finding the right packaging and the inability to source the 'whole animal' for beef due to supply constraints.</data>
