      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Sheri Salatin is the manager of the Polyface Buying Club, responsible for its entire operation, from customer communication to order fulfillment.&lt;SEP&gt;Sheri Salatin is the manager of the Polyface Buying Club, responsible for its operations, logistics, and customer relations strategies.</data>
