    <edge source="Appalachian Sustainable Development" target="Appalachian Harvest">
      <data key="d6">29.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Appalachian Sustainable Development created the Appalachian Harvest brand to market and distribute the produce of the local farmers it supports, establishing a credible market identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Appalachian Sustainable Development is the creator of the 'Appalachian Harvest' brand, which certifies local food in its region.&lt;SEP&gt;Appalachian Sustainable Development is the organization that created and uses the 'Appalachian Harvest' regional brand.</data>
