    <edge source="Appalachian Sustainable Development" target="Larger Grocery Chains">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">After streamlining its operations by working with smaller stores, Appalachian Sustainable Development was able to successfully partner with larger grocery chains.</data>
      <data key="d8">business growth,scaling,supplier relationship</data>
