    </edge>
    <edge source="Appalachian Sustainable Development" target="Post-Industrial Agriculture">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The work of Appalachian Sustainable Development in building a local food system for small farmers directly supports the goals and principles of post-industrial agriculture.</data>
