      <data key="d7">Appalachian Sustainable Development acts as a non-profit wholesale distributor for a network of small-scale farmers.&lt;SEP&gt;Appalachian Sustainable Development is used as an example of a non-profit organization that works as a wholesale distributor for a network of farmers.</data>
