    <edge source="Appalachian Sustainable Development" target="PBS">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The mission and work of Appalachian Sustainable Development were highlighted through an interview its founder, Anthony Flaccovento, gave to the media organization PBS in 2007.</data>
      <data key="d8">media relations,public outreach</data>
