    <edge source="Mie N Yu" target="Local Food Supply Chain">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mie N Yu was the birthplace of the local food supply chain concept, where the model was first conceived, tested, and proven viable by Molovinsky and Miller.</data>
      <data key="d8">incubation,origin point,proof of concept</data>
