    </edge>
    <edge source="Mie N Yu" target="Whole-Animal Cuisine">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mie N Yu serves as a primary example in the text of a restaurant that has successfully and profitably implemented the whole-animal cuisine model.</data>
      <data key="d8">business model,case study,implementation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-65dc312cbeeaa82060b27a69060e671d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mie N Yu" target="Virginia Farms">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mie N Yu directly promotes its partner farms by highlighting their names on the menu as the source of the meat, shifting the marketing focus from the cut to the origin.</data>
      <data key="d8">co-marketing,sourcing,transparency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-65dc312cbeeaa82060b27a69060e671d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tim Miller" target="Oren Molovinsky">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Oren Molovinsky (manager) and Tim Miller (chef) work together at Mie N Yu. They share a professional philosophy, with Miller's focus on whole-animal cuisine supporting Molovinsky's initiative to source whole animals locally.</data>
      <data key="d8">local sourcing,professional collaboration,shared philosophy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-09e000817f207794412f1a62763dda17</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tim Miller" target="Whole Animal Utilization">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">As Executive Chef, Tim Miller actively puts the principle of whole animal utilization into practice in his kitchen, creating dishes that use all parts of the animal.</data>
      <data key="d8">culinary practice,food philosophy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-09e000817f207794412f1a62763dda17</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tim Miller" target="Molovinsky">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Molovinsky collaborated with his executive chef, Tim Miller, at Mie N Yu to re-evaluate and change standard kitchen procedures like using pre-made demi-glace.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,leadership,operational change</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-65dc312cbeeaa82060b27a69060e671d</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
