    <edge source="Oren Molovinsky" target="Virginia Department of Agriculture and Consumer Services">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Virginia Department of Agriculture and Consumer Services facilitated Oren Molovinsky's initial contact with Virginia farmers, which was the catalyst for his entire local sourcing enterprise.</data>
      <data key="d8">business catalyst,government facilitation</data>
