    <edge source="W.K. Kellogg Foundation" target="Grants">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The W.K. Kellogg Foundation is the source of the large grant that, while beneficial in the short-term, inadvertently hindered Troy Gardens' long-term fundraising development.</data>
