    <edge source="Nonprofit" target="Diversified Income Stream">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The text presents a diversified income stream as the ideal financial model for a nonprofit to create fiscal stability and flexibility, contrasting it with grant dependency.</data>
      <data key="d8">best practice,financial strategy</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e0adcf3a18e5a064a6ed2b9d46dff75f</data>
      <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d11">1753740886</data>
