    </edge>
    <edge source="Diablo Burger" target="Gastronomy">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Diablo Burger's mission is explicitly framed around the concept of gastronomy, which it uses to connect the community to the local landscape through food.</data>
      <data key="d8">core concept,mission</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e1fa8277818b65f8d3d6665242021ad9</data>
