    <edge source="Diablo Burger" target="Local Environmental and Economic Sustainability">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Diablo Burger's operational choices, such as accepting only cash, not using a dishwasher, and sourcing locally, are direct implementations of its core commitment to local environmental and economic sustainability.</data>
