      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Diablo Trust is named after and focuses its land management and conservation efforts on the Diablo Canyon area.&lt;SEP&gt;The Diablo Trust was a key participant in creating a rural planning document for the Diablo Canyon area.</data>
